  <para style="h">Gusubiramwo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca gatanu ca Mose citwa Gusubiramwo Ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Gusubiramwo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca gatanu ca Mose citwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Gusubiramwo Ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Urugendo rwo kuva i Horebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Aya ni amajambo Mose yabwiye Abisirayeli igihe bari bakiri mu bugaragwa, mu buseruko bw’uruzi Yorodani. Aho ni mu kiyaya citwa Araba, aharabana n’i Sufi, hagati ya Parani, Tofeli, Labani, Hazeroti na Dizahabu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Mu bisanzwe urugendo rwo kuva ku musozi Horebu gushika i Kadeshi Baruneya rwomara imisi icumi n’umwe gusa ujanye inzira ica ku musozi wa Seyiri.<verse eid="DEU 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ine, ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwawo kw’icumi na rimwe, Mose abarira Abisirayeli ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamutumye kuri bo. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Ivyo vyabaye amaze kunesha Sihoni umwami w’Abamori yaba i Heshiboni, na Ogi umwami wa Bashani yaba muri Ashitaroti amuneshereje ahitwa Edireyi.<verse eid="DEU 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Bakiri hakurya ya Yorodani mu ntara ya Mowabu, Mose atangura gusigurira abantu ibi Vyagezwe, ababwira ati:<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yatubaririye i Horebu ati: ‘Igihe mumaze kuri uwu musozi ni kirekire bikwiye. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Harageze ko mushingura amahema yanyu mukagenda mutumbereye imisozi y’Abamori n’iy’intara zihegereye zo muri Araba, mu misozi, mu biyaya vyo mu burengero, i Negebu no mu kiyaya cegereye ikiyaga, muje mu ntara y’Abanyakanani n’i Libani, mushike no ku ruzi runini, ari rwo Efurate. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Ehe raba, ndabahaye ico gihugu. Nimucinjiremwo mucegukire, ni igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahiye ko azoha ba sogokuruza banyu Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, n’abazobakomokako bose bazokwaruka inyuma yabo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose atoranya abarongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Ico gihe narababwiye nti: “Igikorwa co kubarongora kiraremereye cane sinshobora kugikora jenyene. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yarabagwije ku buryo mungana n’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza, arakabagwiza incuro igihumbi, yongere abahezagire nk’uko yabisezeranye! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Ariko none noshobora nte kwikorera ingorane zanyu, imitwaro yanyu hamwe n’imitongano yanyu jenyene? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Nuko rero nimwitoranirize mu miryango yanyu yose abantu muri mwebwe, b’abanyabwenge, batahura, kandi bubashwe, kugira ngo ndabazeze igikorwa co kubarongora.”<verse eid="DEU 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Mwaranyishuye muti: “Ico utubwiye ni ciza.”<verse eid="DEU 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Ni ho naca mfata abo bantu bo mu miryango yose bafise ubwenge kandi bubashwe, nkabaha ubutware kuri mwebwe, bamwe kurongora ibihumbi, abandi amajana, abandi mirongo itanitanu, abandi na bo cumicumi, ndabagira abatware mu miryango yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Kandi ico gihe nabwiye abacamanza banyu nti: “Muzokwumvirize imanza zizoba hagati y’abantu banyu, muheze mubacire imanza zigororotse, rwaba urubanza ruri hagati y’Abisirayeli babiri, canke hagati y’Umwisirayeli n’umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Ntimuze muhengame mu guca imanza, muze mwumvirize bose, uworoshe co kimwe n’uwuhambaye. Ntimuze mutinye umuntu n’umwe, kuko urubanza muzoca ruzoba ruciwe n’Imana. Muze munzanire imanza zigoye cane, nanje nzozica.” <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Ico gihe narababwiye ivyo mutegerezwa gukora vyose.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose arungika abatasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Maze nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yari yabitubwiye, tuva i Horebu, tugenda twerekeye imisozi miremire yo mu gihugu c’Abamori, duca muri bwa bugaragwa bunini kandi bwica nk’uko mwabubonye, turaheza dushika i Kadeshi Baruneya. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ndaheza ndababwira nti: “Murashitse mu misozi y’igihugu c’Abamori, ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu aduhaye. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />None ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye iki gihugu. Nimuduge mucegukire nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza, yabibabwiye. Ntimutinye, ntimucike intege.”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Ico gihe mwese mwaje aho ndi mumbwira muti: “Reka tubanze turungike abantu bagende gutata ico gihugu, hanyuma bazogaruke batubwire inzira tuzojana, n’ibisagara tuzokwinjira.”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Nanje numvise ko ico ciyumviro ari ciza, nca ntoranya abagabo icumi na babiri, umwe mu muryango wose. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Baraduga muri ico gihugu, bashika mu kiyaya ca Eshikoli, baracihweza neza. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Batora n’ivyamwa vyo muri ico gihugu, barabituzanira, batubwira inkuru zaho, bati: “Igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu aduhaye ni ciza cane.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Ariko ntimwashatse kuduga ngo mucinjiremwo, mugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mwidogeye mu mahema yanyu muvuga muti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aratwanka, yadukuye muri Egiputa kugira ngo aturekurire mu maboko y’Abamori batumare. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Mbega none tuja hehe? Benewacu ko batumye imitima yacu ishongeshwa n’ubwoba. Bavuze bati: ‘Abantu baho barakomeye kuturusha kandi mu burebure baradusumba, ibisagara vyabo ni bininibinini, inzitiro zavyo zikora ku bicu, kandi twarabonyeyo n’abakomoka kuri Anaki.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Ico gihe narababwiye nti: “Ntimucike ivutu, ntimubatinye. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu agendera imbere yanyu azobagwanira, nk’uko mwabonye ibagwanira muri Egiputa, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />n’igihe mwari mu bugaragwa. Harya mwarabonye ingene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabateruye nk’uko umuvyeyi aterura umwana wiwe, gushika mushitse aha hantu.”<verse eid="DEU 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Ariko naho vyabaye gutyo, ntimwigeze mwizera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />yabagendera imbere mu rugendo rwanyu rwose ari mu nkingi y’umuriro mw’ijoro no mu nkingi y’igicu ku murango, abaronderera ibibanza vyiza vyo gucumbikamwo n’inzira mushobora kujana mu rugendo.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yumvise ivyo muvuze araraka, aca ararahira iti: <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />“Nta muntu n’umwe wo muri uru runganwe rubi azobona igihugu ciza narahiye ko nzoha ba sekuruza, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />kiretse Kalebu mwene Yefune. We azokibona kandi hamwe n’uruvyaro rwiwe nzobaha aho bazogeza ikirenge hose, kuko yakurikiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umutima wiwe wose.”<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Kandi kubera mwebwe, na jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaranshavuriye, avuga ati: “Na wewe ntuzokwinjira muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Ariko umufasha wawe ari we Yosuwa mwene Nuni azocinjiramwo. Umutere intege kuko ari we azorongora ihanga rya Isirayeli kugira ngo rishikire iragi. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Kandi urunganwe rushasha mwibaza ko rwari rugiye kugirwa inyagano, abana banyu bataramenya ikibi n’iciza, ni bo bazocinjiramwo. Nzokibaha kibe inyegu yabo. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Ariko wewe, hindukira ufate inzira yo mu bugaragwa ija ku Kiyaga Gitukura.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Ni ho mwishura muti: “Twacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Reka tuduge tuje kugwana nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yabitubwiye.” Maze umwe wese muri mwebwe afata ibigwanisho, mwibaza ko vyoroshe gutera akarere k’imisozi muri ico gihugu.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Babwire uti: ‘Ntimuduge kugwana kuko atazoba ari kumwe namwe. Muzoneshwa n’abansi banyu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Ni ho nabibabwira ariko mwanka kwumva, mugarariza itegeko ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi mu bwibone bwanyu muraduga muja muri iyo misozi. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Abamori baba muri iyo misozi barasohoka kubagwanya, babirukako nk’inzuki, bagenda barabica kuva i Seyiri gushika i Horuma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Mwagarutse muririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko ntiyigera ashira umutima ku marira yanyu, yica amatwi ngo ntabumve. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Ni co catumye mumara i Kadeshi kirya gihe cose mwahamaze.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abibutsa ivyo kuyerera mu bugaragwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Ni ko guca dusubira inyuma tuja mu bugaragwa, duca mu nzira itumbereye ku Kiyaga Gitukura, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabintegetse. Tumara igihe kirekire tuzunguruka mu misozi y’i Seyiri.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />“Igihe mumaze muzunguruka muri ino misozi ni kirekire bikwiye; ubu nimuhindukire mugende mwerekeye mu buraruko. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Uhe abantu aya mategeko akurikira: ‘Mugiye guca mu gihugu ca benewanyu, abakomoka kuri Esawu, baba i Seyiri. Bazobatinya ariko namwe muze mubiyubare. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Ntimuze mubasomborotse ngo mugwane, kuko ata ntara n’imwe yabo nzobaha, sinzobaha n’ahangana n’aho umuntu yohonyoza ikirenge. Esawu namuhaye igihugu ca Seyiri ngo kibe umugabane wiwe. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Ivyokurya vyabo muzorya n’amazi yabo muzonywa, muze mubibagurire ifeza.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Imana yanyu yarahezagiye ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu, yongera ibarinda mu rugendo rwanyu rwose. Inyonga zayo zagumye ku rugendo rwanyu igihe cose mwari muri ubu bugaragwa bunini. Mu myaka mirongo ine yose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabanye namwe, nta kintu na kimwe mwigeze mukena.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Nuko twarabandanije turengana benewacu ari bo ruvyaro rwa Esawu, baba i Seyiri. Turahindukira tuva mu nzira ica muri Araba iduga ivuye ahitwa Elati n’ahitwa Eziyoni Geberi, dufata inzira ica mu bugaragwa bw’i Mowabu.<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Ntimugire ico mupfa n’Abanyamowabu canke ngo mubatere mugwane, kuko ntazobaha n’agatongo na gatoya mu gihugu cabo. Ahantu hitwa Ari nahahaye uruvyaro rwa Loti ngo habe umugabane wabo.”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Ubwoko bw’Abemiti ni bo bahora bahaba kera: bari abantu b’ibigatanya, kandi benshi cane, bari barebare nk’Abanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Abo Bemiti co kimwe n’Abanaki, bose babita Abarefayimu, ariko Abanyamowabu bobo babita Abemiti. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Abahori ni bo bahora baba i Seyiri, ariko abo mu ruvyaro rwa Esawu barabirukanye. Barabatikije, bifatira igihugu cabo nk’uko Abisirayeli babikoze ku gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye ngo bacegukire.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Nimuhaguruke mujabuke ikiyaya c’i Zeredi.” Natwe turahaguruka turakijabuka.<verse eid="DEU 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Hari haheze imyaka mirongo itatu n’umunani kuva duhagurutse tuva i Kadeshi Baruneya gushika tujabuke ikiyaya c’i Zeredi. Ariko ico gihe, urunganwe rwose rw’abagabo bashobora kuja mu ntambara rwari rumaze guhonera mu bugaragwa nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabibarahiye. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwagumye kubagwaniriza aho dushagaje kugeza kubamaze bose.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Igihe uwa nyuma wo muri urwo runganwe rw’abashobora kuja mu ntambara yari amaze gupfa, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca arambarira ati: <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />“Uwu musi mugiye guca muri Ari, mu ntara y’i Mowabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Nimwashikira Abamoni, ntimuze mubasomborotse canke ngo mubatere kugira ngo mugwane, kuko ntazobaha n’agatongo na gatoya mu gihugu c’Abamoni. Nagihaye uruvyaro rwa Loti ngo kibe inyegu yabo.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Ico na co nyene cari kizwi nk’igihugu c’Abarefayimu bahoze bakibamwo, ariko Abamoni babita Abazamuzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Bari abantu b’inkomezi kandi benshi, barebare nk’Abanaki. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abatikiriza imbere y’Abamoni, na bo baca barabirukana bifatira ico gihugu. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabikoze gutyo ku bantu bo mu ruvyaro rwa Esawu bahoze baba i Seyiri, igihe yatikiriza Abahori imbere yabo. Barabirukanye baca baba mu gihugu cabo gushika n’uno musi. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Kandi ivyo vyarashitse no ku bantu bitwa Abawimu bahoze baba mu mihana ishika i Gaza, Abakafutori bakomotse kuri Kafutori barabaranduye, baca begukira igihugu cabo.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingene umwami Sihoni w’i Heshiboni yatsinzwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Haguruka mujabuke akagezi Arunoni. Ehe nshize mu maboko yanyu Sihoni Umwamori, umwami wa Heshiboni, n’igihugu ciwe. Nimumutere mutangure gufata ico gihugu. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Uyu musi nyene ngira ntangure guteza igihumura n’ubwoba amahanga yose ari musi y’izuba. Bazokwumva inkuru zanyu bahinde agashitsi bahagarike imitima kubera mwebwe.”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Tukiri mu bugaragwa bw’i Kedemoti, narungitse intumwa kuri Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni, ndamusaba ko tugiriranira amahoro, ndamubwira nti: <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />“Nimutureke duce mu gihugu canyu. Tuzoguma mu nzira itumbereye ducamwo turengana, ntituzokikama ngo tuje i buryo canke i bubamfu. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Muze mutugurisheko ivyokurya tuzorya n’amazi tuzonywa, tuzobigura amahera. Ico tubasavye ni uko mwotureka tugaca mu gihugu canyu gusa; <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />nk’uko abo mu ruvyaro rwa Esawu baba i Seyiri co kimwe n’Abanyamowabu baba muri Ari baturetse turarengana; kugeza tujabutse uruzi Yorodani, tugashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu aduhaye.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Ariko Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni aratwankira ko tuhaca, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yari yamukomantaje umutima ntiyumvira, kugira ngo imutange mu maboko yanyu, nk’uko mubibona uwu musi.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Murabona ko natanguye kubaha Sihoni n’igihugu ciwe. Nuko rero nimucinjire, mucegukire.”<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Igihe Sihoni n’ingabo ziwe baza kudutegerera i Yahazi ngo batugwanye, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu amutanga mu maboko yanyu, muramwica, mumwicana n’abahungu biwe n’ingabo ziwe zose. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Ico gihe twateye ibisagara vyiwe vyose turabisangangura: abagabo, abagore, abana, ntihasigara n’uwo kubara inkuru. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Ariko ibitungwa n’ibindi vyose twanyaze mu bisagara twafashe, twarabigumije biba ivyacu. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yadufashije gufata Aroweri, igisagara kiri ku nkengera y’umwonga Arunoni no gushika kure i Gileyadi, nta gisagara na kimwe catunaniye. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yabiduhaye vyose. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Kandi dukurikije ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yatubwiye, nta kintu na kimwe twatwaye mu ntara y’Abamoni, canke mu ntara iri ku nkengera z’uruzi Yaboki, canke mu ntara yegereye ibisagara biri mu misozi.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ugutsindwa kwa Ogi umwami w’i Bashani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Hanyuma twarahindukiye dufata inzira iduga ija i Bashani, maze Ogi umwami w’i Bashani n’ingabo ziwe zose baza kudutegera kugira ngo tugwanire ahitwa Edireyi. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Ntimumutinye kuko namutanze mu maboko yanyu, we n’ingabo ziwe zose n’igihugu ciwe. Muze mumukorere nk’ivyo mwakoreye Sihoni umwami w’Abamori, yaganza i Heshiboni.”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu aduha intsinzi kuri Ogi umwami w’i Bashani no ku ngabo ziwe zose. Twarabatikije ntitwasigaza n’umuntu n’umwe. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Ico gihe twafashe ibisagara vyiwe vyose. Mu bisagara mirongo itandatu bari bafise nta na kimwe tutabanyaze, mu ntara yose ya Arugobu, mu bwami bwa Ogi i Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Ivyo bisagara vyose vyari bikingiwe n’inzitiro ndende z’ibihome hamwe n’inzugi zikomeye n’ivyugazo vyazo, hakaba kandi hariho n’imihana myinshi itagira inzitiro. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Bose twarabatikije nk’uko twabigize kuri Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni, tugatikiza ibisagara vyose n’ababibamwo: abagabo, abagore n’abana. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Ariko ibitungwa vyabo n’ivyo twanyaze mu bisagara vyabo twarabitwaye biba ivyacu.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Nuko dufata ibihugu vy’abo bami babiri b’Abamori baba mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, uhereye ku kagezi ka Arunoni ugashika kure ku musozi Herumoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Abanyesidoni uwo musozi Herumoni bawita Siriyoni, Abamori na bo bakawita Seniri. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Twafashe ibisagara biri mu biyaya vyose, dufata n’intara ya Gileyadi yose, dufata n’i Bashani hose gushika kure ahitwa Saleka na Edireyi, ibisagara vy’umwami Ogi w’i Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Umwami Ogi w’i Bashani ni we wenyene yari agisigaye mu Barefayimu. Uburiri bwiwe bwari bukozwe mu vyuma, bukagira ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4.</char></note> z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,8.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. Buracari i Raba ho mu Bamoni gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukugabura igihugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Mu ntara twegukiye ico gihe, umuryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi ni yo nahaye intara y’amaja ruguru ya Aroweri, uciye ku kagezi ka Arunoni, ugashiramwo n’igice c’intara irimwo imisozi miremire y’i Gileyadi, hamwe n’ibisagara vyaho. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Igice ca Gileyadi cari gisigaye hamwe n’intara yose ya Bashani, ari bwo bwami bwa Ogi, nahahaye igice c’umuryango wa Manase. (Iyo ntara yose y’i Arugobu i Bashani kera yari izwi nk’intara y’Abarefayimu. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yayiro, wo mu ruvyaro rwa Manase, afata intara yose ya Arugobu, ari ho hitwa Bashani, gushika ku rubibe rw’Abageshuri n’Abamayaka; yaciye imwitirirwa, ni co gituma gushika n’ubu yitwa Havoti Yayiro.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Gileyadi nahahaye umuryango wa Makiri. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Ariko, imiryango ya Reyubeni n’iya Gadi nayihaye intara iva i Gileyadi, ikamanuka igashika ku kagezi k’uruzi Arunoni (nko hagati y’ako kagezi ni ho hari urubibe), kandi hirya ku ruzi Yaboki ni ho hari urubibe rw’Abamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Urubibe rwabo rwo mu burengero ni uruzi Yorodani mu kiyaya Araba, uvuye i Kinereti gushika ku kiyaga Araba, ari co Kiyaga c’Umunyu, ukamanuka hepfo y’umusozi Pisiga mu buseruko.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Ico gihe nabahaye itegeko nti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahaye iki gihugu ngo mucegukire. Ariko abagabo bose bashobora kuja mu ntambara ni bo bazobanza kujabuka Yorodani imbere y’Abisirayeli bandi. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Ariko abagore n’abana banyu, n’ibitungwa vyanyu, biboneka ko ari vyinshi, bigume mu bisagara nabahaye, <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />gushika <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atanze impore mu bandi Bisirayeli bose nk’uko namwe yayibahaye, na bo bakegukira igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ibahaye hakurya ya Yorodani. Inyuma y’aho, umwumwe wese muri mwebwe arashobora gusubira mu mugabane namuhaye.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yankira Mose kujabuka Yorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Ico gihe nategetse Yosuwa nti: “Wariboneye n’amaso yawe ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye ba bami babiri. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobigenza gutyo no ku bundi bwami bwose buri iyo mugiye. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Ntimuzobatinye; <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobagwanira.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Ico gihe narasenze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ndamwinginga nti: <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />“Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, weretse abasavyi bawe ubukuru bwawe n’inkomezi z’ukuboko kwawe. Mbega ni iyihe Mana yindi mw’ijuru no mw’isi yokora ibikorwa bihambaye nk’ivyo ukora? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Ndeka njabuke nshike hakurya mbone ubwiza bwa kiriya gihugu co hakurya ya Yorodani, kirya gihugu ciza c’imisozi miremire hamwe na Libani.”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Ariko kubera mwebwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarandakiye, ntiyemera no kunyumviriza. Yavuze ati: “Geza aho, ivyo birakwiye. Singomba kuzosubira kukwumva umbarira ikintu na kimwe kuri ivyo. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Haguruka uduge ku musozi Pisiga, urabe mu burengero, mu buraruko, mu buseruko no mu bumanuko, wihweze ico gihugu n’amaso yawe, kuko utazojabuka Yorodani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Ariko tegura Yosuwa, umutere intege kandi umukomeze, kuko ari we azorongora aba bantu, akabajabukana Yorodani akabafasha kwegukira ico gihugu uzobona.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Duca tuguma mu kiyaya kiri hafi ya Beti-Peyori.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Basabwa kwumvira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />None rero yemwe Bisirayeli, mwumvirize amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe ngira ndabigishe. Muyakurikize kugira ngo mubone kubaho, mwinjire mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza ibahaye, mugifate kibe inyegu yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Ntihagire ico muzokwongera ku vyo ndababwira, kandi ntihagire n’ico muzokurako, ariko mukurikize ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ngira ndabahe.<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mwariboneye n’amaso yanyu ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoze kubera Bayali-Peyori. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatikije abo muri mwebwe basenze Bayali, imana y’i Peyori. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Ariko mwese abagumye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu muracariho gushika n’uwu musi.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Raba, nabigishije amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje yari yabintegetse, kugira ngo muzobikurikize nimwashika mu gihugu mugira mwinjire ngo mugifate kibe inyegu yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Muzobikurikize vyose kandi muvyitondere, kuko ni vyo bizokwerekana ubwenge bwanyu n’ugutahura kwanyu mu yandi mahanga kuko azokwumva ivyerekeye ivyo vyagezwe akavuga ati: “Koko rino hanga ni iry’abantu b’ubwenge kandi batahura.” <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Mbega hari irindi hanga rihambaye, rifise imana ziba hafi yaryo nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu aba hafi yacu igihe cose tumusenze? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kandi hari ihanga ririho rihambaye, mu kuba rifise amabwirizwa n’Ivyagezwe bigororotse nk’ivyo ndiko ndabashira imbere uno musi?<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Ariko mubibere maso, kandi mwiyubare ntimuzokwibagire ivyo amaso yanyu yabonye, canke ngo mubireke bive mu mitima yanyu ubuzima bwanyu bwose. Muzovyigishe abana banyu n’abuzukuru banyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Ntimuzokwibagire igihe mwahagarara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ku musozi Horebu, maze Imana ikambarira iti: “Koraniriza abantu bose imbere yanje kugira ngo bumve amajambo yanje hanyuma bige kunyubaha igihe cose co kubaho kwabo muri ico gihugu kandi bazoshobore kuvyigisha abana babo.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Mwibuke ko mwegereye mugahagarara ku ntango y’uwo musozi mu gihe imbeya zarabagiza ziduga hejuru cane mw’ijuru, hari igicu cirabura cane n’umwijima mwinshi bikawutwikira. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuganye namwe ari muri uwo muriro. Mwarumvise ijwi ry’amajambo yiwe ariko ntimwigeze mumubona. Humvikana ijwi gusa. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Yabahaye isezerano, ari yo mabwirizwa icumi, ayo yabategetse gukurikiza, akanayandika ku bisate bibiri vy’amabuye. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantegetse kubigisha amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe kugira ngo muze mubikurikize nimwashika mu gihugu mugiye kwegukira kikaba icanyu, mumaze kujabuka Yorodani.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bihanizwa gusenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Muze mwirinde! Nta shusho y’ikintu na kimwe mwabonye umusi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuganira namwe ku musozi Horebu ari mu muriro. Rero muze mwirinde cane, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />ntimuzokwiyononeshe ikintu na kimwe, kandi ntihazogire ikigirwamana na kimwe mwikorera, caba mw’ishusho y’umugabo canke mw’ishusho y’umugore, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />caba mw’ishusho y’igikoko co kw’isi canke y’inyoni zo mu kirere, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />caba mw’ishusho y’igikwega inda hasi canke y’ifi yo mu kiyaga. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Kandi nimwarangamiza mu kirere mukabona izuba, ukwezi canke inyenyeri, iryo sinzi ry’ivyo kw’ijuru, ntimuze mupfukame ngo musenge ibintu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yashiriyeho amahanga yose ari musi y’ijuru. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Ariko mweho, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarabateruye abakura mw’itanure ry’umuriro rivugutira ivyuma ari ryo Egiputa kugira ngo abagire abantu biwe, inyegu yiharije, nk’uko muri uno musi.<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarandakiye kubera mwebwe, arandahira avyeruye ko ntazojabuka Yorodani ngo ninjire mu gihugu ciza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye ngo kibe inyegu yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nzopfira muri kino gihugu, sinzojabuka Yorodani. Ariko mwebwe muzojabuka mufate ico gihugu ciza kibe icanyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />None rero mwirinde, ntimuzokwibagire isezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yagiranye namwe, ntimuze mukore ikigirwamana na kimwe mw’ishusho y’ikintu na kimwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yababujije. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari umuriro utongora, akaba n’Imana ipfuha.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Nimwamara kuvyara abana mukaronka n’abuzukuru, mukaba muri ico gihugu imyaka myinshi, hanyuma mukononekara, mukibazira ibigirwamana, mugakora ibitabereye mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukayitera kuraka, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />ntoye ijuru n’isi ngo bimbere ivyabona uwu musi, ko muzohonera mu gihugu mugiye kwegukira hakurya ya Yorodani ngo kibe icanyu. Ntimuzokirambiramwo, ahubwo nta kabuza muzorandurwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobasanzaza mu mahanga, kandi bake muri mwebwe ni bo bazorokokera muri ayo mahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobasanzarizamwo. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Muri ayo mahanga muzosenga imana zakozwe n’amaboko y’abantu, izo babaje mu biti no mu mabuye, zitabona, zitumva, zitarya canke ngo zimoterwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Ariko nimwaharonderera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, muzomubona nimwamuronderana imitima n’imishaha yanyu yose. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Nimwaba mu mibabaro, ayo magorwa yose akabashikira, hazogera igihe mugaruke k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mumwubahe. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari Imana y’imbabazi, ntizobaheba canke ngo ibatikize, canke ngo yibagire isezerano yagiranye na ba sogokuruza, iryo yashimangiye n’indahiro yayo.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Murabaza muhereye ku vyabaye muri kahise, ivyabaye mutarabaho, muhereye igihe Imana yarema umuntu kw’isi gushitsa n’ubu, mubaze muhereye ku ntango y’ijuru mugashitsa ku mpera yaryo. Mbega hari ikintu gihambaye nk’ico cari bwaboneke canke ngo mucumve? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Mbega hari irindi hanga rirumva ijwi ry’Imana ivugira mu muriro, nk’uko mwaryiyumviye, kandi mukabaho? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Mbega hari iyindi mana yoba yaragerageje kwikurira ihanga rimwe mu rindi no kuryihariza, ikoresheje ibimenyetso, ibitangaza n’utwumiza hamwe n’intambara; ikoresheje kandi ukuboko kwayo kw’inkomezi kandi kuramvuye, canke mu gukora ibikorwa bihambaye nk’ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yakoreye mu maso yanyu mu gihugu ca Egiputa?<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Ivyo vyose mwavyeretswe kugira ngo mumenye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we Mana wenyene, kandi ko ata yindi iriho. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Yabumvishije ijwi ryayo iri mw’ijuru kugira ngo ibigishe. Yaberetse umuriro uhambaye, mwumva n’amajambo yayo ava muri uwo muriro. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Kuko yakunze ba sogokuruza, igatoranya uruvyaro rwabo, ikabakuza muri Egiputa, ukugaragara kwayo n’ububasha bwayo bukomeye, <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />yirukana imbere yanyu amahanga manini kandi akomeye kubarusha, ibashikana mu gihugu cabo, irakibaha muracegukira nk’uko biri uno musi.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Nuko rero mwame mwibuka mu mitima yanyu ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we Mana hejuru mw’ijuru no hasi kw’isi, kandi ko ata yindi Mana iriho. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Muzokurikize amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe vyayo, ivyo ndabahaye uwu musi, kugira ngo ivyanyu n’ivy’uruvyaro rwanyu bizogende neza, muzorambire mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye ngo kizobe icanyu ibihe vyose.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibisagara vy’ubuhungiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Nuko Mose atoranya ibisagara bitatu vyo hakurya ya Yorodani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />ivyo uwuzokwica umuntu wese azohungiramwo, iyo yishe umubanyi wiwe akaba abikoze atabishaka, atahora amuhigira canke ngo abe yahora amufitiye urwanko. Azohungira mu gisagara kimwe muri ivyo bitatu. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Ivyo bisagara vyari ibi: Bezeri co mu bugaragwa mu misozi migufimigufi ku bantu bo mu muryango wa Reyubeni, Ramoti c’i Gileyadi ku bantu bo mu muryango wa Gadi, hamwe na Golani c’i Bashani ku bantu bo mu muryango wa Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intangamarara y’ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe Mose yahaye Abisirayeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ng’ibi ivyashinzwe, amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe Mose yahaye Abisirayeli igihe bari bavuye muri Egiputa, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />igihe bari bacumbitse mu kiyaya ca Beti-Peyori hakurya ya Yorodani, mu gihugu cahoze gitwarwa na Sihoni umwami w’Abamori, yaba i Heshiboni, yaneshejwe na Mose afadikanije n’Abisirayeli igihe bari bavuye muri Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Begukiye igihugu ciwe hamwe n’igihugu catwarwa na Ogi, umwami w’i Bashani; abami babiri b’Abamori baba hakurya ya Yorodani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Ivyo bihugu vyava ahitwa Aroweri no ku nkengera z’akuzi Arunoni bigashika ku musozi Siyoni, ari wo Herumoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />bafata na Araba hakurya ya Yorodani, gushika ku Kiyaga c’Umunyu co mu kiyaya Araba, ku ntango z’umuzosi Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Amabwirizwa icumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Mose Ahamagara Abisirayeli bose arabakoranya, ababwira ati: Tega amatwi yemwe Bisirayeli! Umviriza ivyagezwe n’amabwirizwa ndabahaye uwu musi, kugira ngo muyige mwongere muyakurikize.<verse eid="DEU 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yagiranye isezerano natwe ku musozi Horebu. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Iryo sezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyarigiranye na ba sogokuruza, yarigiranye na twebwe, twebwe abakiriho uno musi. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yivuganiye namwe imbonankubone ari mu muriro kuri wa musozi. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Ico gihe nari nk’umuhuza hagati y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> namwe kugira ngo ndabashikirize amajambo y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko mwari mwatinye umuriro ntimwaduga ku musozi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">Yaravuze iti:<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />“Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, yagukuye muri Egiputa, igihugu wabayemwo uri umugurano.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />Ntukagire izindi mana umbangikanya.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />Ntukibazire ikigirwamana mw’ishusho y’ikintu na kimwe, caba ico hejuru mw’ijuru canke hasi kw’isi, canke i kuzimu, canke mu biyaga. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Ntuzovyikubite imbere canke ngo ubikorere, kuko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe ndi Imana ipfuha, mpanira abana ivyaha vya ba sekuruza babo gushika ku runganwe rwa gatatu n’urwa kane rw’abanyanka. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Ariko abankunda bagakurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, ndabereka urukundo gushika ku runganwe rw’igihumbi.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />Ntukavuge izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe ku busabusa. Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atazobura guhana abakoresha izina ryiwe ukutariko.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Wame uhimbaza umusi w’Isabato, uzokwame ari umusi wejejwe nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe yabigutegetse. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Uze ukore ibikorwa vyawe vyose mu misi itandatu, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />ariko umusi w’indwi ni Isabato y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe. Kuri uwo musi, ntuzogire igikorwa na kimwe uwukorako, yaba wewe, umuhungu canke umukobwa wawe, yaba umukozi wawe w’umuhungu canke w’umukobwa, impfizi, indogoba canke ikindi gitungwa cawe ico ari co cose, canke umunyamahanga aba iwawe, kugira ngo umukozi wawe w’umuhungu n’uw’umukobwa bazoruhuke nk’uko nawe uzoba uruhutse. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Mwibuke ko mwari abagurano muri Egiputa, kandi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabakujeyo ikiganza gikomeye, n’ukuramvura ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi. Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabategetse guhimbaza umusi w’Isabato.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />Wubahe so na nyoko nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabigutegetse, kugira ngo uzorambire mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe iguhaye, kandi ivyawe bizogende neza.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />Ntukice.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />Ntugasambane.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />Ntukibe.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />Ntukarementanirize ibinyoma mugenzawe.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />Ntukipfuze umugore wa mugenzawe. Ntukipfuze inzu yiwe canke itongo, umukozi wiwe w’umuhungu canke w’umukobwa, inka yiwe canke indogoba, canke ikindi kintu cose ca mugenzawe.”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze n’ijwi rirenga abibwira ikoraniro ryanyu kuri wa musozi ari mu muriro, mu gicu no mu mwijima ukomeye; kandi nta kindi yongeyeko. Yaciye avyandika ku bisate bibiri vy’amabuye, arabimpa.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Ariko igihe mwumva ijwi riva mu mwijima, kandi umusozi wuzuyeko imbeya z’umuriro, abatware b’imiryango yanyu bose baje aho ndi. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Barambarira bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yatweretse ubwiza bwiwe n’ubukuru bwiwe, kandi twiyumviye ijwi ryayo ivugira mu muriro. Uwu musi twiboneye ko Imana ishobora kuvugana n’umuntu kandi akabaho. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />None rero ni kubera iki twokwishira mw’irinde ry’urupfu? <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu niyasubira kuvugana natwe, nta kabuza tuzopfa. Urya muriro uhambaye uratuyigiza. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Mbega hari umuntu buntu ashobora kwumva ijwi ry’Imana ivugira mu muriro nk’uko twayumvise, hanyuma akabaho? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />None rero nabe ari wewe ugenda wegere wumvirize ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu avuga, hanyuma ugaruke utubwire ivyo yakubariye vyose, natwe tuzokwumvira tubikurikize.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarabumvise igihe mwambarira ukwo, araheza ambarira ati: “Niyumviye ivyo abo bantu bakubwiye, kandi ivyo bavuze vyose ni vyiza. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ese imitima yabo yokwama yicisha bugufi, bakantinya bakongera bakanyubaha, bakama bakurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, kugira ngo ivyabo bize bigende neza kuri bo no ku ruvyaro rwabo, ibihe vyose.<verse eid="DEU 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Genda ubabwire basubire mu mahema yabo. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Ariko wewe uce ugaruka ugume ngaha ndaguhe ivyagezwe, amabwirizwa n’amategeko uzobigisha, kugira ngo bazobikurikize nibamara gushika mu gihugu ngira ndabahe ngo bacegukire.”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />None rero mwiyubare kugira ngo muzokore ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abategeka vyose, ntihagire na kimwe muzoca i ruhande. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Muzogume mu nzira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobereka, ni ho ivyanyu bizogenda neza, mukarambira muri ico gihugu muhawe ngo mucegukire.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mukundishe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imitima yanyu yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Aya ni yo mategeko, amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yampaye ngo ndabibigishe, kugira ngo muzobikurikize nimwamara gushika mu gihugu, ico mugira mwinjiremwo mujabutse Yorodani mukacegukira, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />kugira ngo mwe n’abana banyu n’abuzukuru banyu muze mwame mutinya bifatanije n’ukwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ukubaho kwanyu kwose, mukurikiza aya mabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe ndabaha uwu musi, kugira ngo muzonezerererwe kurambira muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Tega amatwi yewe Isirayeli, kandi witeho cane kwumvira kugira ngo ivyawe bizogende neza, ugwirire cane mu gihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza yabigusezeraniye.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Tega amatwi, yewe Isirayeli: <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, ni yo Mana imwe rudende. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Ukundishe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe umutima wawe wose, umushaha wawe wose, n’inkomezi zawe zose. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Aya mabwirizwa ndabahaye uwu musi azokwame mu mitima yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Muzokwame muyigisha abana banyu. Muzohore muyaganirako mwicaye i muhira canke muri ku rugendo, iyo mugiye kuryama n’iyo muvyutse. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Muzoyabohere ku maboko, muyambare no mu ruhanga nk’ivyibutso. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Muzovyandike ku bishimaryango vy’amazu yanyu, no ku nzugi z’amarembo yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyabashikana mu gihugu yasezeraniye ba sogokuruza Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo ko azokibaha, igihugu cuzuye ibisagara bininibinini mutubatse, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />amazu yuzuye ivyiza vyinshi mutarondeye, amariba mutimvye, inzabibu n’imyelayo mutateye maze mukabirya mugahaga, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />muze mwirinde, ntimuze mwibagire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabakuye muri Egiputa, mu gihugu c’ubuja.<verse eid="DEU 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Wubahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, abe ari yo yonyene ukorera. Niwagira indahiro, uze urahire mw’izina ryayo gusa. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Ntimuzosenge imana z’amahanga azoba abakikuje; <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu iba muri mwebwe ari Imana ipfuha. Uburake bwayo bwobaziriringira ikabarandura, ikabakura kw’isi. <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Ntimukagerageze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu nk’uko mwabigize i Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Ariko muzokurikize amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, hamwe n’ivyagezwe n’amategeko yose yabahaye. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Muzokore ibiroranye mu nyonga z’Imana, kugira ngo ivyanyu bizogende neza. Ni ho muzokwinjira mukegukira ico gihugu ciza cane <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yasezeraniye ba sogokuruza ko azokibaha, mukakibamwo. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />Muze mwirukane abansi banyu bose baba muri ico gihugu, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabivuze.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Mu myaka iri imbere abana banyu bazobabaza bati: “Mbega ivyagezwe, amabwirizwa n’amategeko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yabahaye bisigura iki?” <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Muzobishure muti: “Twari abagurano ba Farawo muri Egiputa, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yadukujeyo ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoze ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza biteye ubwoba, bishika kuri Egiputa no kuri Farawo n’abantu biwe amaso yacu avyibonera. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Kandi, yadukuye muri Egiputa kugira ngo aduhe igihugu yari yarasezeraniye ba sogokuruza bacu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yadutegetse gukurikiza aya mategeko no gutinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu bifatanije no kumwubaha, kugira ngo ivyacu bizogende neza, twongere turambe nk’uko biri uno musi. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Kuko nitwakurikiza neza ibi vyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu vyose nk’uko yabidutegetse, ni vyo bizoba ukugororoka kwacu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwirukana amahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyabashikana mu gihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo ngo mucegukire, akirukana imbere yanyu ayandi mahanga menshi ari yo y’Abaheti, Abagirugashi, Abamori, Abanyakanani, Abaperizi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi, ari yo mahanga indwi maninimanini kubasumvya; <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyamara kuyatanga mu maboko yanyu mukayanesha, muzoyarandure muyamare. Ntihazogire isezerano na rimwe mugirana na yo, kandi ntimuzoyagirire impuhwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Ntimuzokwabirane na bo. Ntimuzobahe abakobwa banyu kandi n’abahungu banyu ntibazosabe abakobwa babo, <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />kuko bohava batesha inzira nziza abahungu banyu, bakamvako bagakorera izindi mana, hanyuma uburake bwanje jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bukaka kuri bo nk’umuriro, nkabarandura mu kanya isase. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Uku abe ari ko muzobagenza: muzosambure ibicaniro vyabo, mumenagure n’amabuye y’aho batangira ibimazi vyabo, mutemagure inkingi bashingiye ikigirwamana Ashera, muturire n’ibigirwamana vyabo vyose. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Kuko muri ihanga ryejejwe Imana yitoranirije. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabatoranije mu yandi mahanga yose yo kw’isi, kugira ngo mube abantu biwe, itunga rihambaye yiharije.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyabakundishije umutima wiwe wose kubera mwasumvya ubwinshi abandi bose, ahubwo mwari ihanga rito ku yandi mahanga yose. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Ariko ni kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabakunze, agashitsa indahiro yarahiye ba sogokuruza. Ni vyo vyatumye abazana n’ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi, akabarokora mu gihugu c’ubuja, mu bubasha bwa Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />None rero mumenye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari Imana. Ni umwizigirwa, azigama isezerano ry’urukundo gushika ku runganwe rw’igihumbi ku bamukunda bagakurikiza amabwirizwa yiwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Ariko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 7:10">abamwanka azobahemba ukubatikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 7:10">kandi ntazoteba.<verse eid="DEU 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />None rero, muzokurikize aya mabwirizwa, ivyagezwe n’amategeko ndabahaye uno musi.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Nimwayashirako umutima, mukitwararika kuyakurikiza, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoguma mw’isezerano ry’urukundo yabasezeraniye, nk’uko yabirahiye ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Azobakunda, abahezagire, yongere abagwize. Azohezagira imbuto zo mu nda zanyu, ivyimburwa vyo mu matongo yanyu nk’ingano, umuvinyu mushasha n’amavuta ya Elayo, kandi azohezagira n’inyana z’ibitungwa vyanyu hamwe n’imyagazi y’imikuku yanyu mu gihugu yarahiye ba sogokuruza ko azokibaha. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Muzohezagirwa gusumba ayandi mahanga yose, nta n’umwe wo muri mwebwe azoba ingumba, kandi nta n’igitungwa na kimwe canyu kizoba ingumba. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobakingira ingwara zose. Ntazobateza ingwara n’imwe nk’iziteye ubwoba mwabonye muri Egiputa, ariko azoziteza abansi banyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Muzotikize abantu bose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotanga mu maboko yanyu. Ntimuze mubagirire akagongwe kandi ntimuzosenge imana zabo, kuko zobabera umutego.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Mushobora kwibwira mu mitima muti: “Aya mahanga aradusumvya inkomezi. Mbega tuzobirukana dute?” <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Ariko ntimuzogire ubwoba, mwibuke ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yakoreye Farawo na Egiputa yose. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Mwariboneye n’amaso yanyu, imibabaro, ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza, ukuboko gukomeye kandi kuramvuye kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yabakujeyo. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azokorera nka birya ayo mahanga yose mutinya. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Ikirengeye ivyo, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobarungikamwo amavubi gushika n’aho n’uwabinyegeje azoranduka. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Ntibazobatere ubwoba kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari muri mwebwe ari Imana y’igitangaza. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azokwirukana amahanga imbere yanyu, bukebuke. Ntazobakundira ko muyirukanira icarimwe yose, kuko ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba vyohava bibabana vyinshi. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobatanga mu maboko yanyu, abateze ukuzazanirwa gushika batikiye bose. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Azotanga abami babo mu maboko yanyu, namwe muzozimanganya amazina yabo musi y’ijuru. Nta n’umwe azobahagarara imbere ngo abagwanye; muzobarandura bose. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Ibishushanyo vy’imana zabo muze mubiturire. Ntimuze mwipfuze ifeza n’inzahabu zabo, kandi ntimuze mubitware, kuko muzoba muguye mu mutego wabo, kuko ari ibisesema k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Ntihaze hagire igisesema na kimwe mwinjiza mu mazu yanyu, kuko mwohava muranduka, kandi ari vyo bikwiye kuranduka. Mutegerezwa kwanka ibintu nk’ivyo kuko vyagenewe kuzorandurwa.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ntimuze mwibagire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Mube maso kugira ngo mukurikize ibi vyagezwe ndabahaye uwu musi, ni ho muzobaho, mukagwira, mukinjira, mukegukira igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yasezeraniye ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Mwibuke ingene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabarongoye mu bugaragwa muri iyi myaka mirongo ine yose, kugira ngo ibacishe bugufi yongere ibagerageze, imenye ibiri mu mitima yanyu, irabe ko muzokurikiza amabwirizwa yayo. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Yabacishije bugufi mu kubareka ngo musonze, hanyuma ibagaburira manu, iyo mutari bwigere mumenya, yaba mwebwe canke ba sogokuruza banyu, kugira ngo ibigishe ko umuntu adatungwa n’indya gusa, ariko ko ashobora gutungwa n’ijambo ryose rivuye mu kanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Impuzu zanyu ntizigeze zishira, kandi n’ibirenge vyanyu ntivyigeze bivyimba muri iyo myaka mirongo ine yose. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />None rero mutahure mu mitima yanyu ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yariko arabatoza indero nka kurya umuvyeyi atoza indero umwana wiwe.<verse eid="DEU 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Mukurikize amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mugendere mu nzira ziwe, mumutinye bifatanije no kumwubaha. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abajanye mu gihugu ciza cane, igihugu kirimwo imigende y’amazi n’amariba, n’inzuzi zitemba mu biyaya no mu misozi, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />igihugu kirimwo ingano, imizabibu n’imisukoni, amakomamanga, amavuta ya elayo n’ubuki; <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />igihugu kitigera kibura ivyokurya, ata na kimwe kibuzeyo. Igihugu usanga amabuye yaco ari ubutare n’imitumba mushobora kwimbamwo ubundi butare bw’umujumbu.<verse eid="DEU 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Nimwamara kurya mugahaga, muzoshime <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahaye igihugu ciza nk’ico. <verse eid="DEU 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Muze mwirinde ntimuze mwibagire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ngo munanirwe no gukurikiza amabwirizwa, ivyagezwe n’amategeko vyiwe, ivyo ndabaha uwu musi. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Ahandi ho nimwarya mugahaga, mukubaka amazu mezameza yo kubamwo mu bisagara, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />ibitungwa vyanyu bikagwira, inzahabu n’ifeza mufise bikiyongera, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />imitima yanyu izokwishira hejuru, mwibagire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, yabakuye muri Egiputa, mu gihugu c’ubuja. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Yabarongoye mu bugaragwa buteye ubwoba kandi bwica, igihugu c’inyota kitagiramwo amazi, kirimwo inzoka z’ubumara na sikoropiyo. Yabakuriye amazi mu gitandara. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Yabahaye manu mu bugaragwa, ikintu ba sogokuruza banyu batigeze bamenya, kugira ngo ibacishe bugufi yongere ibagerageze ku bw’ineza yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Ivyo vyose yabikoze kugira ngo ntihaze hagire uwibwira mu mutima ati: “Ubu butunzi bwose naburonse kubera inkomezi n’ibikorwa vyanje.” <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Ariko Muzokwame mwibuka <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu kuko ari yo ibashoboza kuronka ubutunzi, kugira ngo ishitse isezerano yaseraniye ba sogokuruza ririko n’indahiro, nk’uko biri uno musi.<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Ariko ndababwije ukuri ko nimwava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mugakurikira izindi mana, mukazisenga, mukazunamira, muzorandurwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaranduye ayandi mahanga imbere yanyu, ni ko namwe muzorandurwa nimutumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Icatumye Imana yirukana amahanga imbere y’Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Tega amatwi yewe Isirayeli. Ehe mugira mujabuke Yorodani, mwinjire mwongere munyage amahanga maninimanini kandi akomeye kubarusha, afise ibisagara bininibinini, vy’inzitiro zikora kw’ijuru. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Ababibamwo barakomeye kandi ni barebare, ni bo Banaki. Murazi ivyabo kuko mwarumvise havugwa ngo: “Ni nde yohagarara imbere y’Abanaki?” <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Ariko mumenye neza ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari we azoja imbere yanyu mu kujabuka, abitangire imbere ameze nk’umuriro utongora. Azobahonya; abamare inkomezi imbere yanyu; namwe muheze mubatere mubirukane nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabibasezeraniye.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyamara kwirukana ayo mahanga imbere yanyu, ntimuzokwibwire mu mitima yanyu muti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatuzanye gufata kino gihugu kuko turi abagororotsi.” Haba na gatoya. Ni ububi bw’ayo mahanga butumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayirukana imbere yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Si kubera ubugororotsi bwanyu canke ubwizigirwa bwanyu mugiye kwinjira ico gihugu mukacegukira, ni ububi bwayo buzotuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abirukana, kugira ashitse ivyo yarahiye ba sogokuruza bacu Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Nuko rero mutahure neza ko atari kubera ukugororoka kwanyu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye iki gihugu ngo mucegukire, ahubwo mwibuke ko muri abantu b’intagondwa.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bibutswa ivyerekeye ishuri yakozwe mu nzahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Muzokwame muvyibuka, kandi ntimuze mwigere mwibagira ingene mwashavuje <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu muri mu bugaragwa. Kuva igihe mwava muri Egiputa gushika n’ubu mwamye mugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ku musozi Horebu mwashavuje <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahakwa kubatikiza. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Igihe naduga ku musozi gutora ibisate vy’amabuye, ibisate vy’isezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagiranye namwe, namaze ku musozi imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine nyene, ntarya, ntanywa. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ampa ibisate bibiri vy’amabuye vyandikishijweko n’urutoke rw’Imana. Kuri vyo hariko amabwirizwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahereye ku musozi ari mu muriro, ku musi mwari mwakoranye.<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine biheze, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampaye ivyo bisate bibiri vy’amabuye, ari vyo bisate vy’isezerano. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambarira ati: “Ihute umanuke, kuko ba bantu bawe wakura muri Egiputa bononekaye. Bamaze kuva mu nzira nabategetse kugenderamwo, bicuriye ikigirwamana.”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Niboneye aba bantu ingene ari intagondwa. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />None rero mbisa, kugira ngo ndabarandure n’izina ryabo ndarizimanganye musi y’ijuru. Nawe nzoheza ndakugire ihanga rikomeye, rinini gusumba bo.”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Ni ho nahindukira nkamanuka, nkava kuri uwo musozi waka umuriro. Nawumanutse mfise mu minwe ivyo bisate vy’amabuye vy’isezerano. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Ndavye mbona mwacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mwicuriye ikigirwamana mw’ishusho y’ishuri. Mwari mwamaze kuva mu nzira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaberetse. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Nca mfata vya bisate vy’amabuye ndabikubita hasi, biramenagurika bicika ubunywenywe imbere y’amaso yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Ariko nsubira kuja kwikubita imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mara iyindi misi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine ata co ndya, ata co nywa, kubera ivyaha mwari mwakoze, mu gukora ibitabereye mu nyonga z’Imana, mukayitera kuraka. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Natinye ishavu n’uburake vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko yari abarakiye bikomeye agira abarandure. Ariko arasubira aranyumvira. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarakariye bikomeye na Aroni agira amurandure, ariko na we nyene muri ico gihe ndamusabira, aramubabarira. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Hanyuma mfata ca kimenyetso c’icaha canyu ari yo ya shuri mwacuze, ndagiturira, mpejeje ndagisya, gicika ifu kimera nk’umukungugu, ndawusuka mu mugende w’amazi utemba uva ku musozi.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mwarasubiriye muramushavuza i Tabera, i Masa n’i Kiburoti Hatava.<verse eid="DEU 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Kandi igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabarungika muva i Kadeshi Baruneya yavuze ati: “Nimuduge mufate igihugu ndabahaye ngo kibe icanyu.” Ariko mugarariza amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Ntimwamwizeye canke ngo mumwumvire. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Mwamye mugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuva igihe nabamenya.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Napfukamiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndamutakambira muri iyo misi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamaze gufata ingingo yo kubarandura. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Nasenze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mvuga nti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, nturandure abantu bawe, ubwoko wiharije, abo wacunguje ububasha bwawe ukabakuza muri Egiputa ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Niwibuke abasavyi bawe Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, maze wirengagize ubugarariji bw’ubu bwoko, wirengagize ibibi n’ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Niwabarandura, Abanyegiputa bazovuga bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyaramunaniye gushikana abantu biwe mu gihugu yabasezeraniye, kandi kubera abanka, yabakuye ino kugira ngo aje kubatikiriza mu bugaragwa.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Ariko ni abantu bawe, ni inyegu yawe wakuje muri Egiputa ububasha bwawe n’ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mose ahabwa ibindi bisate vy’amabuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Ico gihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarambariye ati: “Ibazire ibindi bisate bibiri vy’amabuye bimeze nka bimwe vya mbere, ubaze n’isandugu mu mbaho yo kubibikamwo, uheze uduge ku musozi aho ndi. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Nzokwandikira kuri ivyo bisate amajambo yari kuri bimwe wamena, uheze ubibike muri iyo sandugu.”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Nuko nca mbaza isandugu mu giti c’ikasiya, mbaza n’ibisate vy’amabuye bibiri bimeze nka bimwe vya mbere, nca nduga ku musozi ntwaye vya bisate bibiri mu minwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yandika kuri ivyo bisate ivyo yari yanditse ku vya mbere, ari yo mabwirizwa icumi yari yababwiriye ku musozi ari mu muriro, umusi mwari mwakoranye. Ahejeje, arabimpa. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Ni ho nagaruka mvuye kuri uwo musozi, ngashira vya bisate muri ya sandugu nari nabaje nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabintegetse, kandi n’ubu ni yo biri.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Maze Abisirayeli bafata urugendo rwo kuva ku mariba y’ahantu hitwa Bene Yakani, baja i Mosera. Aho ni ho Aroni yapfiriye, bamuhambaho, umuhungu wiwe Eliyazeri aramusubirira nk’umuherezi mukuru. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Bavuye aho bagiye i Gudigoda bashika n’i Yotubata, igihugu kirimwo inzuzi nyinshi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Ico gihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatoranije umuryango wa Lewi ngo abe ari wo urerura Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bagahagarara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bagakora igikorwa c’ubuherezi, bakongera bagahezagira abantu mw’izina ryiwe, nk’uko babikora n’ubu. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Ni co gituma Abalewi ata co batoranye muri benewabo, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we mugabane wabo, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabibabwiye.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Jewe rero nagumye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine, nk’uko nari nabigenjeje ubwa mbere, ico gihe na ho nyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aranyumvira, yemera kutabarandura. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Genda urongore abantu bafate urugendo, binjire igihugu nasezeraniye ba sogokuruza ko nzokibaha, kibe icabo.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bongera kubwirwa gutinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kumwumvira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />None rero Bisirayeli, mbega ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abagombako si ukumwubaha no kugendera mu nzira ziwe zose, mukamukunda, mukamukorera n’imitima yanyu yose, n’imishaha yanyu yose, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />no gukurikiza amabwirizwa n’amategeko y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabahaye uwu musi, ku bw’ineza yanyu?<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Ijuru ndetse n’amajuru yo hejuru cane hamwe n’isi n’ibiri muri yo vyose ni ivy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yerekanye umutima w’urukundo kuri ba sogokuruza banyu, arabakunda, hanyuma atoranya mwebwe uruvyaro rwabo, abarutisha ayandi mahanga yose nk’uko biri uno musi. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Nuko rero nimukebwe mu mitima yanyu, muve mu bugarariji. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari Imana isumba ivyitwa imana vyose, akaba Umwami w’abami, Imana ihambaye, ikomeye kandi y’igitangaza, idahengamira kuri nkunzi kandi idahabwa igiturire. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Iburanira impfuvyi n’abapfakazi, ikunda abanyamahanga baba hagati muri mwebwe, ikabagaburira, ikabambika. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />None rero namwe mukunde abanyamahanga bari muri mwebwe, kuko namwe mwigeze kuba abanyamahanga muri Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mutinye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, bifatanije no kumwubaha, kandi mumukorere. Mwifatanye na we, indahiro yanyu ibe izina ryiwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Ni yo Mana yanyu, ni yo yonyene ikwiye gushimwa, iyakoze ibitangaza biteye ubwoba nk’ivyo mwiboneye n’amaso yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Ba sogokuruza banyu bamanutse muri Egiputa bari mirongo indwi bose hamwe, ariko raba ubu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yarabagwijije mungana n’inyeyeri zo kw’ijuru.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mukunde kandi mwumvire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Mukunde <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukurikize ivyo ababwiye, amategeko, amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe vyiwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Uno musi, mwibuke ko atari abana banyu babonye kandi baronse indero y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ikoresheje icubahiro cayo, ukuboko kwayo kw’ubushobozi kandi kuramvuye; <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />si bo babonye ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza yakoreye hagati muri Egiputa, kuri Farawo umwami no ku gihugu ciwe cose ca Egiputa; <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye ingabo zose za Egiputa, amafarasi n’imikogote vyabo, ingene yabisutse mu Kiyaga Gitukura, igihe bariko barabakurikira, n’ingene yabagesheje ubutakivayo. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Si abana banyu babonye ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabakoreye kuva igihe mwari mu bugaragwa kugeza mushitse muri iki kibanza, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />si bo babonye ivyo yakoreye Datani na Abiramu, bene Eliyabu wo mu muryango wa Reyubeni, igihe isi yasama hagati mu Bisirayeli ikabamirana n’abo mu nzu zabo bose, amahema yabo n’ikintu cabo cose gihumeka. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Ariko, amaso yanyu ni yo yiboneye ivyo bitangaza vyose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoze.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />None rero mwirinde, kugira ngo muzokurikize amabwirizwa ndabahaye uwu musi, kugira ngo muronke inkomezi zo kujabuka Yorodani no kwinjira muri ico gihugu mukagifata, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />kugira ngo muzoshobore kurambira muri ico gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahiye ba sogokuruza ko azokibaha hamwe n’uruvyaro rwabo, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Igihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo mukacegukira ntikimeze nka Egiputa mwahoramwo, aho mwaruha muvomera ibiterwa vyose nk’uwuvomera imboga. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Ariko igihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo mukacegukira ni igihugu c’imisozi n’ibiyaya kivomererwa n’imvura. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Ni igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu we nyene yitaho, inyonga ziwe zama kuri co kuva ku ntango y’umwaka gushika mu mpera yawo.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Rero nimwumvira mugakurikiza ivyo amabwirizwa ndabahaye uwu musi avuga, ni ukuvuga gukunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu no kumukorera n’imitima yanyu yose n’imishaha yanyu yose, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />na we, azorungika imvura mu gihe cayo, iy’agatasi n’iy’impeshi, kugira ngo mushobore kwimbura ingano, imivinyu n’amavuta ya elayo. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Azotanga ubwatsi mu buragiro bw’ibitungwa vyanyu, kandi namwe muzoronka ivyo murya muhage.<verse eid="DEU 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Ariko rero mwirinde, mwoye guhendwa mu mitima yanyu ngo muve k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukorere izindi mana mwongere muzisenge. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Nimwabikora, uburake bw’Imana buzoziriringa kuri mwebwe, hanyuma azokwugara ijuru ntiribe rigitanga imvura, kandi isi ntizoba ikimera ibiterwa. Namwe muzotikirira muri ico gihugu ciza cane <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahaye. <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Aya majambo yanje muyashire mu mitima yanyu no mu bwenge bwanyu, muyabohere ku maboko no mu ruhanga nk’ivyibutso. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Muzoyigishe abana banyu, muyaganireko iyo mwicaye i muhira n’iyo muri ku rugendo, iyo mugiye kuryama n’iyo muvyutse. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Muzovyandike ku bishimaryango vy’amazu yanyu, no ku nzugi z’amarembo yanyu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />kugira ngo mwe n’abana banyu muzorambire muri ico gihugu, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahiye ba sogokuruza ko azokibaha, gushika igihe ijuru rizoba rikiri hejuru y’isi.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Nimwakurikiza neza amabwirizwa mbahaye uno musi, ari yo gukunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, kugendera mu nzira ziwe zose no kwifatanya na we, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we azokwirukana ayo mahanga yose imbere yanyu, naho ari maninimanini cane, akomeye cane kubarusha, kandi muzoyigarurira. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Aho muzohonyoza ikirenge hose hazoba bahaye ahanyu. Imbibe zanyu zizova ku bugaragwa bw’i Libani, no ku ruzi Efurate zishike ku Kiyaga Mediterane co mu burengero. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Nta muntu n’umwe azoshobora kubahagarara imbere ngo abagwanye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azogwisha abantu igihumura kubera mwebwe, aho muzoja hose, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabibasezeraniye.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Ehe raba uwu musi mbashize imbere imigisha n’imivumo, <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />imihezagiro mu gihe mwemeye kwumvira aya mabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ayo ndabahaye uno musi, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />imivumo nimwanka kwumvira aya mabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukava mu nzira yabategetse kugenderamwo, mugasenga izindi mana mutari bwabone. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyabashikana muri ico gihugu mukagifata, muzokwaturire imigisha ku musozi Gerizimu, imivumo na yo muzoyivugire ku musozi Ebalu. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Iyo misozi yose iri hakurya ya Yorodani, mu ntara y’Abanyakanani, amaja mu burengero, hafi y’ibiti vya More, mu ntara y’Abanyakanani baba muri Araba hafi y’igisagara ca Gilugali. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Ehe mugira mujabuke Yorodani mufate igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye. <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />Nimwagishikamwo mukakibamwo, muzoshire imitima yanyu ku gukurikiza amategeko n’ivyagezwe ndabahaye uwu musi.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ikibanza kimwe co gusengeramwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Aya ni yo mabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe mutegerezwa kwitwararika gukurikiza igihe cose muzoba mukiba muri kino gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza abahaye ngo mucegukire. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Muzosangangure ibibanza vyose vyo ku misozi, ku mitumba no musi y’ibiti, aho abanyamahanga muzokwirukana bahora basengera imana zabo. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Muzomenagure ibicaniro vyabo, mumenagure n’amabuye yabo, muturire n’inkingi za Ashera, musatagure n’ibishusho vy’imana zabo, muzimanganye n’amazina y’imana zabo muri ivyo bibanza.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Ntimuze musenge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu nk’uko basenga imana zabo. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Ariko muzorondere ikibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azokwitoraniriza mu miryango yanyu, ikibanza izina ryayo rizokwambarizwamwo. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Abe ari ho muzoja, mujanye amashikanwa yo guturirwa hamwe n’ibimazi, ibigiracumi n’amashikanwa adasanzwe, ivyo mwasezeranye gushikanira Imana n’ivyo mutanze mwishakiye, hamwe n’imfura z’ibitungwa n’imikuku vyanyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Aho hantu, muri kumwe n’imiryango yanyu kandi muri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aze abe ari ho muzohora murira mwongera munezerererwa ibintu vyose mwaronse kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahezagiye.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Ntimuzobikore nk’uko tubikora ngaha, kuko ngaha umwe wese abikora uko yumva bibereye kuri we, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />kubera yuko mutarashika mu gihugu c’uburuhukiro, igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Ariko muzojabuka Yorodani mube mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi, kandi izobaha kuruhuka intambara mwaterwa n’abansi banyu babakikije hanyuma mwibere mu mutekano. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yitoreye ngo ahashire Izina ryiwe, azobe ari ho muzomushikanira ibi ndababwiye vyose: amashikanwa yo guturirwa, hamwe n’ibimazi, ibigiracumi n’amashikanwa adasanzwe, hamwe n’ivyo mwasezeranye gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Hanyuma muri ngaho, muze munezererwe kuba imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mwebwe, abahungu banyu n’abakobwa banyu, abakozi b’abahungu n’abakobwa hamwe rero n’Abalewi baba mu bisagara vyanyu kuko ata matongo canke ibisagara batoranye. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Muze mwirinde ntimushikanire amashikanwa yo guturirwa aho mwishakiye. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Muzoyashikanire mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotoranya mu muryango umwe mu miryango yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Ariko murashobora kuzobagira ibitungwa vyanyu mu bisagara vyanyu, mukarya inyama uko muvyipfuza, ari nk’ingeregere canke impongo, mukurikije uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yabahezagiye. Abasanzwe bahumanye n’abadahumanye bose bashobora kuziryako. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Ariko amaraso yavyo ntimuzoyarye, muzoyasese hasi nk’amazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Ntimuzorire mu bisagara vyanyu ibigiracumi vy’ingano n’umuvinyu mushasha hamwe n’amavuta ya Elayo, canke imfura z’ibitungwa n’iz’imikuku vyanyu, canke ikindi kintu cose mwasezeranye gutanga caba ico mutanze mwishakiye canke ayandi mashikanwa adasanzwe. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Ahubwo muzobirire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mu kibanza azoba yitoranirije. Muzobisangire n’abana banyu, abahungu n’abakobwa, abakozi banyu b’abahungu n’abakobwa hamwe n’Abalewi baba mu bisagara vyanyu, kandi muzonezererwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu vyo muzoba mwaronse. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Muzokwiyubare ntimufate minenerwe Abalewi bazoba bari muri mwebwe igihe cose muzoba mukiba muri ico gihugu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyamara kwagura intara zanyu nk’uko yabibasezeraniye, hanyuma mukipfuza kurya inyama, mukavuga muti: “Ndipfuza inyama” muzorye izo mushaka zose. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Hamwe na ho ikibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azokwihitiramwo ngo citirirwe Izina ryiwe kibaye kure yanyu, muzobage ibitungwa vyanyu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye, nk’uko nabibabwiye, mubibagire mu bisagara vyanyu, murye ivyo mwipfuza vyose. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Muzobirye nk’uko mworya ingeregere canke impongo. Kandi bose abahumanye n’abadahumanye barashobora kuziryako. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Ariko muzokwirinde ntimurye amaraso, kuko amaraso ari bwo buzima, rero ntimuzorye ubuzima hamwe n’inyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Ntimuzorye amaraso, ariko muzoyasese hasi nk’amazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Ntimuzoyarye, kugira ngo ivyanyu, mwe n’uruvyaro rwanyu ruzokwaruka inyuma bize bigende neza, kuko muzoba mukoze ibigororotse mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Ariko muzofate amashikanwa yejejwe, ayo mwasezeranye gushikana, muheze nuyatware mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yahisemwo. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Muzoshikane ku gicaniro amashikanwa yanyu yo guturirwa, inyama hamwe n’amaraso. Amaraso y’ibimazi vyanyu muzoyasuke i ruhande y’igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ariko inyama muzozirye. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Mwiyubare kugira ngo muze mwumvire aya mategeko ndabahaye yose, kugira ngo ivyanyu, mwe n’abana banyu bazokwaruka inyuma yanyu, bizokwame bigenda neza, kuko muzoba muriko murakora ibigororotse mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azotikiza imbere yanyu amahanga mugiye gutera no kunyaga igihugu. Ariko nimwamara kubirukana mukaba mu gihugu cabo, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />kandi bamaze kurandurwa imbere yanyu muze mwiyubare ntimuzogwe mu mutego wo kurondera kumenya ivyerekeye imana zabo, mukavuga muti: “Mbega aya mahanga yasenga imana zabo gute? Dushaka gusenga nka bo.” <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Ntimuzosenge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu nk’uko basenga imana zabo, kuko mu gusenga kwabo bakora ibizira vy’ubwoko bwose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanka. Mbere baratanga abahungu n’abakobwa babo kugira ngo baturirwe kw’ibimazi vy’ishikanwa bashikaniye imana zabo.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Mube maso, mukurikize ivyo ndababwiye vyose, ntihagire ico mwongerako canke ngo hagire ico mukurako.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyo gusenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Nihagira umuvugishwa canke umuntu asobanura indoto ahaguruka muri mwebwe akababwira ibizoba, agatanga ibimenyetso canke ibitangaza, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />hanyuma vya bitangaza bishitse akababwira ati: “Nimuze dukurikire izindi mana tuzikorere,” ababwira imana mutari muzi, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />ntimuzokwumvirize amajambo y’uwo muvugishwa canke uwo murosi. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba ariko arabagerageza ngo arabe ko mumukunda n’imitima yanyu yose, n’imishaha yanyu yose. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ni we wenyene wo gukurikira, kandi ni we wo gutinywa bifatanije no kwubahwa. Mukurikize amabwirizwa yiwe, mwongere mumwubahe, mumukorere, mwongere mumwumireko. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Uwo muvugishwa canke uwo murosi azokwicwe, kuko azoba ariko arabigisha kugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, yabakuye muri Egiputa, abarokoye mu buja. Kuko bazoba bariko barabakura mu nzira z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, muzobice, ni ho muzoba mukuye ikibi muri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Nihagira mwenewanyu, umuhungu wawe canke umukobwa wawe, umugore wawe ukunda cane, canke umugenzi wawe, akwongorera ati: “Ingo tuje gusenga izindi mana,” imana mwe na ba sogokuruza mutari bwabone, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />imana z’amahanga abakikuje, zaba iza kure canke iza hafi, zaba izo mu ntara iyi canke iriya, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />ntimuzomwumvirize. Ntimuzomugirire impuhwe, ntazobure kwicwa, ntihazogire uwumukingira. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Ntaze abure kwicwa! Wewe yongoreye uzobe uwa mbere kumukubita, hanyuma abandi na bo bazokwifatanye na we mu kumwica. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Muzomwicishe amabuye, kuko yagomba kubakura mu nzira y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabakuye muri Egiputa, mu gihugu c’ubuja. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Maze Abisirayeli bose bazovyumva batinye, nta n’umwe wo muri mwebwe azosubira gukora ibintu nk’ivyo.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Nimwamara kuba mu gisagara kimwe mu bisagara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />mukumva ko hari umunyakibi yahagurutse mu gisagara, akosha abandi avuga ati: “Ingo tuje gusenga izindi mana,” imana mutari muzi, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />muzotohoze neza mwitonze. Nimwasanga ivyo bamuvugako ari vyo, mugasanga yakoze ikizira nk’ico muri mwebwe, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />ico gisagara muzogitere, mukiririkishe inkota, murandure abakibamwo bose, mumare n’ibitungwa vyaho. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Muzokwegeranye ivyo mwanyaze vyose mubishire ku kibuga muheze mubiturirane n’igisagara cose, maze bibe nk’ikimazi gituririwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Kizokwame ari umusaka, ntikizokwigere gisubira kwubakwa. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Ntihaze hagire na kimwe mu vyagenewe guturirwa mwisigariza, kugira ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asubize hasi uburake bwiwe, abagirire imbabazi, abagirire impuhwe yongere abagwize, nk’uko yabirahiye ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobagirira impuhwe nimwamwumvira mugakurikiza amabwirizwa yiwe ndabahaye uno musi, mugakora ibimuhimbara.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Indya zihumanye n’izidahumanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Muri abana b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Nimwagandarira uwapfuye, ntimuzokwimoshe umushatsi wo mu ruhanga, <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />kuko muri ubwoko bwatoranijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Mu yandi mahanga yose yo kw’isi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatoranije mwebwe ngo mube ubutunzi bwiwe.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />None rero ntimuzorye ikintu na kimwe kizira. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Ibi ni vyo bikoko mwemerewe kurya: inka, intama, impene, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />impongo, ingeregere, ifumberi, impene y’inyeshamba, inzobe, imbogo, hamwe n’intama y’inyeshamba. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Muremerewe kandi kurya igikoko cose gifise ikinono gisatuye kandi cuza ivyo cariye; <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />ariko ibidafise ibinono bisatuye kandi bituza, ntimuzobirye. None rero ntimuze murye ingamiya, agakwavu, canke inkezi, naho vyuza, ibinono vyavyo ntibisatuye; ivyo birahumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Ingurube na yo nyene irahumanye, kuko naho ifise ibinono bisatuye, ntiyuza. Ntimuzorye inyama zavyo, ntimuzokore no ku mivyimba yavyo.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Mu biba mu mazi vyose, mwemerewe kurya ibifise amababa n’ibigaragamba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Ibidafise amababa n’ibigaragamba ntimuze mubirye, birahumanye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Murashobora kurya ibiguruka vyose bidahumanye. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Ariko ibi bikurikira ntimuzobirye: inkona, ikinyakabaka, inkukuma, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />ikinyamwanira, icaruzanyoni nk’uko amoko yavyo ari, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />ubwoko bwose bw’ibikona, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />ikigendabunyovu, sarumfune, inguriguri, n’amoko yose y’ubuca; <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />igihuna, ikirovyi, inyanana, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />ikinyamwanira, inkongori, ikiryamivyimba, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />agasoza, ubwoko bwose bw’inyange, samunsure, n’agahungarema.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Udukoko twose dufise amababa tukagendera ku maguru ane, turahumanye kuri mwebwe, ntimuze muturye. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Ariko ibindi bikoko vyose bifise amababa bidahumanye muzobirye.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Ntimuzorye ikintu na kimwe muzosanga capfuye. Muzobihe abanyamahanga bazoba bari muri mwebwe, canke muzokigurishe ku banyamahanga. Ariko mwebwe ntimuzokirye kuko muri ubwoko bwejejwe kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Ntimuzotekeshe umwagazi w’impene amata ya nyina wayo.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibigiracumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Muzokwame mwegeranya ikigiracumi c’ivyo mwimbuye mu mirima yanyu ku mwaka ku mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Muzorire ibigiracumi vyanyu vy’ingano, imivinyu misha, n’amavuta ya elayo, hamwe n’imfura z’ibitungwa n’imikuku vyanyu, mubirire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mu kibanza azokwitoraniriza ngo citirirwe izina ryiwe, kugira ngo mumenye kwama mumutinya bifatanije no kumwubaha ibihe vyose. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Ariko ico kibanza kibaye kure yanyu, hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu akaba yarabahezagiye mutoshobora gushikanayo ibigiracumi vyanyu, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />muzokabe ibigiracumi vyanyu n’ifeza, muzijane mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaratoranije. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Muzokoreshe izo feza mu kugura ivyo mukeneye, ari inka, intama, impene, imivinyu ihiye n’ibindi binyobwa vyose mwipfuza. Mwe n’imiryango yanyu muheze mubirire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, munezerwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Kandi ntimuze mwibagire Abalewi baba mu bisagara vyanyu, kuko ata matongo canke iragi bafise mu bisagara vyabo.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Ku mpera y’umwaka ugira gatatu, muzozane ibigiracumi vy’ivyimburwa vy’uwo mwaka, mubishingure mu bubiko bw’ibisagara vyanyu, <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />kugira ngo Abalewi, bo badafise ishamvu yabo bwite barazwe, hamwe n’abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi baba mu bisagara vyanyu baronke ico barya bahage, ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azohezagira ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Umwaka wo kurekurira abaheranye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Uko imyaka indwi irangiye, uze uhebere imyenda abayigufitiye. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Uku ni ko bikwiye kugenda: Uwaguranye mugenziwe w’Umwisirayeli azomuhebere umwenda wiwe. Ntihazogire uwishuza umubanyi wiwe canke incuti yiwe y’Umwisirayeli, kuko igihe c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> co guheberanira imyenda kizoba cageze. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Uzokwishuze abanyamahanga, ariko benewanyu b’Abisirayeli uzobahebere imyenda bagufitiye. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Kandi, ntihaze hagire umukene aba muri mwebwe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobahezagiza ubutunzi mu gihugu abahaye ngo kibe iragi ryanyu, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />nimwumvira ijwi ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu rwose, mugakurikiza amabwirizwa yose ndabahaye uno musi. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobahezagira nk’uko yabisezeranye, muzoha ingurane amahanga menshi, ariko mwebwe nta we muzoyisaba. Muzoganza amahanga menshi ariko mwebwe nta hangana na rimwe rizobaganza.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Nimwashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abajanyemwo, hanyuma hakagira umukene aba muri mwebwe, ntimuzokomantaze imitima ngo mureke kumusangiza ku vyo muzoba mufise. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Ariko muzopfumbaturure ibiganza, mumugurane ivyo akeneye vyose n’umutima ubikunze kandi mutagoberewe. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Ntihaze hagire ivyiyumviro bibi biba mu mitima yanyu, mwibwira muti: “Umwaka w’indwi, ari wo mwaka wo guheberanira imyenda urageze,” hanyuma ngo mureke kugurana benewanyu bari mu bukene, mukareka kubafasha. Azoririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we azobona ko mwakoze icaha. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Muzobagurane n’umutima ubikunze, ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azohezagira ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Hazokwama hariho abakene mu gihugu. Ni co gituma ndababwiye ngo muze mupfumbatururire ibiganza vyanyu benewanyu n’abakene bazoba bari muri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwidegemvya kw’abagurano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Nihagira Umuheburayo canke Umuheburayokazi yigurisha kuri mwebwe nk’umugurano akabakorera imyaka itandatu, ku mwaka ugira indwi muzomurekure yidegemvye. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Kandi nimwamurekura, ntimuzomurungike iminwe misa. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Muzomutekerere bimwe mu bitungwa vyanyu, ku vyimburwa bivuye ku mbuga zo gukubitirako ingano no ku mivinyu yanyu. Muzomutekerere bivanye n’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yarabahezagiye. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Muze mwibuke ko namwe mwabaye abagurano muri Egiputa, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu akabacungura. Ni co gutuma nanje ndabahaye iri bwirizwa uwu musi.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Ariko umugurano wawe niyakubwira ati: “Singomba kuvana nawe,” kuko agukunda wewe n’umuryango wawe, kandi akaba amererewe neza iwawe, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />uzofate icuma umutobore ugutwi ahagaze mu muryango w’inzu, hanyuma abe umugurano wawe ubuzima bwiwe bwose. Uzobikore gutyo no ku mugurano w’umukobwa.<verse eid="DEU 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Kurekura umugurano wanyu ntuze ubifate nk’amananiza, kuko ibikorwa azoba yagukoreye muri iyo myaka itandatu bizoba bisumba kabiri ivyo umukozi uhemba yogukorera, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe azohezagira ibikorwa vy’amaboko yawe.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibitungwa vy’uburiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Muzokwegurire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu amashuri y’uburiza azovuka ku bitungwa n’imikuku vyanyu. Ntimuze mwigere murimisha ishuri nk’iyo kandi ntimuze mumwe impfizi z’intama zanyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Uko umwaka utashe umuntu wese hamwe n’umuryango wiwe muzoje murayarira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mu kibanza azoba yaratoranije. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Hamwe igitungwa coba gifise agasembwa, gihumye canke gicumbagira, ntimuzogitangeko ikimazi c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Ahubwo muzokirire mu bisagara vyanyu, abahumanye n’abadahumanye barashobora kukirya, nk’aho yoba ari ingeregere canke impongo. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Ariko ntimuze murye amaraso yaco. Amaraso yaco muzoyasese nk’amazi.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Pasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Mu kwezi kwa Abibu, muzohore muhimbaza Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, kuko muri ukwo kwezi kwa Abibu ari ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabakuye muri Egiputa, hakiri mw’ijoro. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Muzoshikanire ibimazi vya Pasika <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mukuye mu bitungwa no mu mikuku vyanyu, mubimushikanire muri ca kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yaratoranije ngo habe Izina ryiwe. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Ntimuzorye imikate irimwo umwambiro, ariko muzomare imisi indwi murya imikate itarimwo umwambiro, ni yo mikate y’imibabaro, kuko mwavuye muri Egiputa mwihuta, kugira ngo mu buzima bwanyu muzokwame mwibuka igihe mwaviriye muri Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Ntihaze hagire umwambiro uba mu vyo mutunze mu gihugu canyu muri iyo misi ndwi. Ntihaze hagire inyama z’ibimazi vyanyu zirara ngo zishike mu gitondo.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Ntimuze mupfe igisagara mushikaniyemwo ibimazi vya Pasika mu bisagara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahaye, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />kiretse muri ca kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaritoranirije ngo habe izina ryiwe. Aho ni ho muzoshikanira ibimazi vya Pasika ku mugoroba, izuba rirenze, mwibuka umusi mwaviriyeko muri Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Muze muteke inyama z’ico gitungwa muzirire muri ico kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaratoranije, bukeye muheze musubire mu mahema yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Muzomare imisi itandatu murya imikate itarimwo umwambiro, ku musi ugira indwi na ho muzogire ikoraniro imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, kandi ntimuze mugire igikorwa muwukorako.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusi mukuru w’amayinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Muzoharure amayinga indwi uhereye ku musi mwatanguriyeko kugenya ingano mukoresheje urukero mu gihe co kwimbura, <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />muheze muhimbaze umusi mukuru w’amayinga mu guha icubahiro <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mumushikanire amashikanwa avuye ku mitima ikunze kubera imigisha azoba yarabahaye. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Muzoheze munezerererwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu muri muri ca kibanza azoba yaratoranije kugira habe Izina ryiwe, mwe n’abana banyu, abakozi banyu b’abahungu n’abakobwa, Abalewi bazoba baba muri mwebwe, abanyamahanga, n’impfuvyi n’abapfakazi bazoba bari muri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Muzokwame mwibuka ko mwabaye abagurano muri Egiputa, maze muheze mukurikize neza aya mategeko yose.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imisi mikuru y’insago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Muze mwame muhimbaza imisi mikuru y’insago, mumare imisi indwi muyihimbaza, mumaze kwegeranya ivyimburwa ku bivuye ku mbuga zo gukubitirako ingano no ku mivinyu yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Muzonezerererwe iyo misi mikuru, mwe n’abana banyu, abakozi banyu b’abahungu n’abakobwa, Abalewi, abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi bazoba baba mu bisagara vyanyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Muze mumare imisi indwi muhimbaza iyo misi mikuru mwibuka <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mumuhimbariza mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yitoranirije. Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yabahezagiriye indimiro zanyu, agahezagira n’ibikorwa vyose vy’amaboko yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Abagabo bose bo muri mwebwe bazoze imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu gatatu ku mwaka, mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yaratoranije. Aho na ho hazoba ari ku musi mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro, mu misi mikuru y’amayinga, no mu misi mikuru y’insago. Ntihaze hagire umuntu azoja imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ata co atwaye. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Umwe wese azogende atwaye ishikanwa rihwanye n’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaramuhezagiye.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abacamanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Muze mutore abacamanza n’abatware mu miryango yose no mu bisagara vyose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, baze bacire abantu imanza zibereye. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Ntimuze muce izigoramye canke ngo mugire nkunzi. Ntimuzorye ibiturire, kuko bihuma amaso abanyabwenge, bikagoramika amajambo y’intungane. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Muze mukurikire kugira ubutungane, kandi ubutungane bw’ukuri, kugira ngo mubone kubaho no kwegukira igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo gusenga izindi mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Ntihaze hagire inkingi n’imwe ya Ashera muzoshinga i ruhande y’aho muzoba mwubatse igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Ntimuze mushinge n’amabuye, kuko ivyo ari igisesema k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Ntimuze mushikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu inka canke intama igwaye canke ifise agasembwa, ni ikizira kuri we.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Nihagira umugabo canke umugore muri mwebwe wo mu gisagara na kimwe mu vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yarabahaye muzosanga ariko akora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, arenga kw’isezerano, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />akarenga ku mabwirizwa yanje, agasenga izindi mana, akazunamira canke akunamira izuba, ukwezi canke inyenyeri zo mu kirere, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />mukamwumva muze mutohoze neza. Nimwasanga koko ico kizira carakozwe mu Bisirayeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />muzofate uwo mugore canke uwo mugabo yabikoze mumutware kw’irembo ry’igisagara canyu, mumwicishe amabuye. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Azokwicwe habanje kuboneka ivyabona bibiri canke bitatu, ariko ntihazogire uwicwa habajijwe icabona kimwe gusa. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Kandi icabona kizobe ari co kibanza kumutera ibuye, abandi na bo bazokurikire. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubucamanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Nihagira imanza zigoye babazanira, zaba iz’ubwicanyi canke ugukomeretsanya, muzozitware muri ca kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaratoranije. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Muzozishikirize abaherezi ari bo Balewi, canke umucamanza azoba ari ku gikorwa ico gihe. Bazoheza barwumvirize hanyuma baruce. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Muzokurikize ico bazobabwirira mu kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yaratoranije. Muze mube maso kugira ngo mukore ico bazobabwira cose. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Muze mukore mukurikije ivyo babigishije vyose n’ivyo bababwiye vyose. Ntimuze muhengamire i buryo canke i bubamfu rw’ivyo bababwiye. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Nihagira uwishira hejuru akanka urubanza umucamanza canke umuherezi azoba ahagaze akorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaciye, aze yicwe. Muzoba mukuye ikibi mu Bisirayeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Abantu bose bazovyumva batinye, maze birinde kwishira hejuru.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Nimwashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, mukagifata kikaba icanyu, mukakibamwo, hanyuma mukiyumvira muti: “Reka twiyimikire umwami natwe nk’ayandi mahanga adukikuje,” <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />muze mube maso kugira ngo mwimike uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yabahitiyemwo. Azobe umwe muri benewanyu b’Abisirayeli. Ntimuze mwimike umunyamahanga, atari Umwisirayeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Uwo mwami ntaze atunge ifarasi nyinshi canke ngo arungike abantu muri Egiputa kuzironderayo, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yababwiye ati: “Ntimuze mwigere musubira gufata inzira ija muri Egiputa.” <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Ntaze agire abagore benshi, kuko umutima wiwe wohava uta inzira ukava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntazokwirundanirize inzahabu n’ifeza.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Niyamara gufata intebe y’ubwami, azokwiyandikishirize ikopi y’igitabu c’ibi Vyagezwe, agikuye muri kirya c’abaherezi, ari bo Balewi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Azocamane kandi azokwame agisoma imisi yose y’ukubaho kwiwe, kugira ngo amenye ingene yubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, n’ingene yokurikiza amajambo y’Ivyagezwe n’amategeko ari muri co. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Bizomufasha kwirinda kwifata nk’aho asumba benewabo, canke guhengamira i buryo canke i bubamfu ngo ave muri ya mategeko. Ni ho we n’uruvyaro rwiwe bazorambira ku ngoma muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ishikanwa ry’Abalewi n’Abaherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Abaherezi, ari bo Balewi, mbere umuryango wa Lewi wose, nta matongo canke iragi bazoronka muri Isirayeli. Bazobeshwaho n’amashikanwa y’ibifungurwa azokwama ashikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku gicaniro, uwo ni wo uzoba umugabane wabo. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Nta mugabane bazoronka muri benewabo. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we mugabane wabo, nk’uko yabibasezeraniye.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Uwu ni wo mugabane abaherezi bazoronka ku bimazi vy’inka, impene n’intama abantu bazoshikana: igikanu, imisaya, n’izo mu nda. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Muzobahe ku vyeze vya mbere vy’ingano, imivinyu mishasha, n’amavuta ya Elayo hamwe n’ubwoya bwa mbere bw’intama, <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabatoranije hamwe n’uruvyaro rwabo rwose mu yindi miryango yose kugira ngo bakorere izina ryiwe ibihe vyose.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Nihagira Umulewi ava mu gisagara kimwe mu bisagara vyanyu ico ari co cose muri Isirayeli, akaja muri ca kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yaratoranije, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />azokore igikorwa c’ubuherezi mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe nk’abandi Balewi bazoba bakorera Imana aho. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Bazogabure banganye ivyo baronka ngaho, n’aho yoba asanzwe afise amafaranga yakuye mu vyo umuryango wiwe wagurishije.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ugusenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Nimwashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, ntimuzokwigane imigenzo isesema y’amahanga y’aho. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Ntihaze hagire uwutanga umwana w’umuhungu canke w’umukobwa ngo aturirwe nk’ikimazi, umuntu aragura canke aroga, uwusobanura kazoza, agakora ivy’ubupfumu, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />canke ahamagara ivyago, canke ahamagara imizimu, canke asiguza abapfuye. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Umuntu wese akora ivyo ni igisesema k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi iyo migenzo y’ibizira ni yo nyene izotuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yirukana ayo mahanga imbere yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Mutegerezwa kuba inyankamugayo imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abavugishwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Amahanga mugiye kwirukana, arumviriza abarozi n’abapfumu. Ariko mwebwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ntabemerera kubikora. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobahagurukiriza umuvugishwa ameze nkanje muri mwebwe, mu Bisirayeli bagenzi banyu, Muzomwumvire, <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />kuko ico ari co mwasavye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu igihe mwari mwakoraniye i Horebu. Mwavuze muti: “Ntidushaka gusubira kwumva ijwi ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, canke ngo tubone ikibengebenge c’umuriro, kuko twopfa.”<verse eid="DEU 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambariye ati: “Ivyo bavuze ni vyiza. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Nzohagurutsa umuvugishwa muri mwebwe; nzoshira amajambo yanje mu kanwa kiwe, na we azoshikiriza abantu ivyo nzomutegeka vyose. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Uwutazokwumviriza amajambo yanje uwo muvugishwa azovuga mw’izina ryanje, jewe ubwanje nzobimuharurako. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Ariko uwuzokwigira uwuvugishwa mw’izina ryanje akavuga ivyo ntamutumye, canke hakaza umuvugishwa avugishwa mw’izina ry’izindi mana, azokwicwe.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Mushobora kwibaza muti: “Mbega tuzomenya gute ko ubuvugishwa kanaka butavuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?” <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Nihagira uwuvugishwa mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ariko ivyo yavugishijwe ntibishike canke ngo bibe ivy’ukuri, ubwo buvugishwa ntibuzoba bwavuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ibisagara vy’ubuhungiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyarandura amahanga ari mu gihugu abahaye, mukabirukana hanyuma mukaba mu bisagara no mu mazu yabo, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />muzotoranye ibisagara bitatu vy’ubuhungiro mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye ngo mucegukire. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Muze murabe neza, ico gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, mukigaburemwo ibice bitatu, igice cose kibe gifise ico gisagara c’ubuhungiro. Nihagira uwica umuntu azogihungiremwo.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Iri ni ryo tegeko rigenga umuntu yishe uwundi agaca ahungirayo kugira ngo akize amagara yiwe, ni uwishe mugenziwe atabishaka, ata rwanko yahora amufitiye. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Nk’akarorero, umuntu ashobora kuba ari mw’ishamba na mugenziwe kwicira ibiti, hanyuma abanguye incabiti ariko aricira, iyo ncabiti ikaroka igashibuka ikica uwo mugenziwe. Uwo muntu aze ahungire muri kimwe muri ivyo bisagara kugira ngo akize ubugingo bwiwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Bitabaye uko, uwuhora amaraso y’uwo yapfuye ashobora kumukurikira yuzuye uburake, agahava amushikira nimba urugendo rwo gushika muri ico gisagara ari rurerure, hanyuma akamwica kandi atari akwiye kwicwa, kuko atishe mugenziwe amufitiye urwanko. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Ni co gituma ndabahaye ibwirizwa ryo kwitoraniriza ibisagara bitatu.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyabagurira igihugu nk’uko yabisezeraniye ba sogokuruza ashizeko n’indahiro, akakibaha cose nk’uko yabibasezeraniye, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />muze mutoranye ibindi bisagara bitatu vy’ubuhungiro. Azobaha ico gihugu nimwitondera neza amabwirizwa ndabahaye, mugakunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukagendera mu nzira ziwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Muzobikore ukwo kugira ngo ntihazogire amaraso asesekera ubusa mu gihugu canyu, ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi ryanyu, ni ho mutazoharurwako amaraso azoba yasesetse.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Ariko nihagira umuntu agirira akazikira mugenziwe, hanyuma akamubundira, akamusimbirako akamwica, hanyuma agahungira muri kimwe muri ivyo bisagara, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />abatware b’ico gisagara bazomutumeko, bamusubize mu gisagara ciwe, bamushikirize uwuhora amaraso amwice. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Ntimuzomugirire imbabazi. Mutegerezwa gukura uwagirizwa icaha c’ubwicanyi mu Bisirayeli, kugira ngo ivyanyu bizogende neza.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Nimwashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi, ntimuze mwigere mwiha itongo ry’uwundi mu kwigiza hirya akarimbi ba sogokuruza banyu bashinze ku matongo yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyabona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Ntihaze hagire uwo muzokwagiriza icaha mwumvirije icabona kimwe gusa. Muzoce urubanza mwumvirije ivyabona bibiri canke bitatu.<verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Nihagira icabona cagiriza umuntu icaha kibesha, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />uwagirizwa n’uwagiriza bazozanwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imbere y’abaherezi n’abacamanza bakiri mu bikorwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Abacamanza bazokore amatohoza neza, basanze ico cabona kibesha, kigatanga ivyemezo bitari vyo mu kwagiriza mwenewabo w’Umwisirayeli, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />muzomucire nk’urwo yashaka gucira mwenewabo. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Abandi nibavyumva baze batinye, ntihagire uwuzosubira kwubahuka gukora ikibi nk’ico muri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Ntimuzomugirire imbabazi: ubuzima buzohorwe ubundi, ijisho rihorwe irindi, iryinyo rihorwe irindi, ukuboko guhorwe ukundi, ikirenge gihorwe ikindi.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyo kuja mu ntambara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Nimwaja kugwana n’abansi banyu, mukabona bafise imikogote n’amafarasi hamwe n’ingabo zisumba izanyu, ntimuzobatinye. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabakuye muri Egiputa, izoba iri kumwe namwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Nimwitegurira kuja mu ntambara, umuherezi azoze imbere y’ingabo azibwire ijambo. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Azobabarire ati: “Nimunyumvirize yemwe Bisirayeli! Uyu musi mugiye kugwanya abansi banyu. Ntimuranduke imitima canke ngo mutinye. Ntimuzohinde agashitsi imbere yabo. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari we azojana namwe kugwanya abo bansi banyu, akabaha intsinzi.”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Abatware bazobaze ingabo bati: “Mbega hari uwoba yari yubatse inzu ariko akaba atari bwayibemwo? Nabanze asubire inyuma kuko yohava agwa ku rugamba, uwundi akaba ari we ayinjira. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Mbega hari uwoba yari afise umurima w’uruzabibu ariko akaba atari bwatangure kururyako? Nasubire inyuma, kuko yohava agwa ku rugamba, uwundi akaba ari we agwirira. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Mbega hari uwoba yari yakoye umwigeme mugabo akaba atari bwamurongore? Nasubire inyuma arongore umugeni wiwe, kuko yohava agwa ku rugamba hanyuma uwo mugeni akarongorwa n’uwundi.” <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Abo batware baze bongereko bati: “Mbega hari uwumva afise ubwoba canke asimbwa n’umutima? Nasubire i muhira kugira ngo ntatume bagenziwe basimbwa n’umutima.” <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Abatware nibamara kubabwira ayo majambo bazoce bagena abakuru barongora imigwi y’ingabo.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Nimwegereza igisagara kanaka kugira ngo mugitere, muzobanze gusaba abakibamwo mugiranire isezerano ry’amahoro. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Nibavyemera mu mahoro bakabugururira imiryango y’ibisagara vyabo, abantu baho bose muzobagire abagurano banyu mubakoreshe ibikorwa biruhije. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Naho nibanka ko mugiriranira isezerano ry’amahoro, ico gisagara muzogitere, mugifate. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyagishira mu maboko yanyu, muzokwicishe inkota abagabo bo muri co bose. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Ariko abagore, abana, ibitungwa n’ibindi vyose muzosanga muri ico gisagara, muzobigire iminyago yanyu. Ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yabahaye nk’iminyago muzobikoreshe ico mushaka. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Ariko ivyo muzobigirire ibisagara vyose vya kure, ntimuzobikorere ibisagara vy’amahanga yo mu gihugu mugiye kwinjira.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Mu bisagara vyo mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi ryanyu, ntimuzosigaze igihumeka na kimwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Muzobatikize bose: Abaheti, Abamori, Abanyakanani, Abaperizi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabibategetse. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Nimwabareka bakabaho, bazohava babigisha gukora ibizira vyose bakora iyo basenga imana zabo, gutyo mugacumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Nimwatera igisagara mukacugariza igihe kirekire, ntimuzotikize ibiti vyama ivyamwa muvyiciza incabiti, kuko muzokenera kurya ivyamwa vyavyo. Ntimuzovyicire. Mbega bizoba bibaye abantu ngo muvyugarize? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Ariko ibiti bidatanga ivyamwa muzovyicire, mubikuremwo ibikoresho muzoba mukeneye vyo kwugariza igisagara c’abansi banyu, gushika mukinesheje.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Uguhongera uwishwe ntihamenyekane uwamwishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Nimwasanga umuntu yishwe, aryamye hasi mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahaye nk’iragi, ariko ntimumenye uwamwishe, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />abatware n’abacamanza bazogere imetero z’uburebure ziri hagati y’ico kiziga n’igisagara kiri hafi yaco. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Nibamara kubona igisagara kiri hafi yaco, abatware b’ico gisagara bazofate ishashi y’inka itarigera ikoreshwa ibikorwa vyo kurima, canke ngo yambikwe ingogo, <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />bayimanukane ku mwonga utigeze urimwa ngo uterwemwo ibiterwa, urimwo amazi aguma atemba. Maze iyo shashi baze bayivunire izosi muri uwo mwonga. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Abaherezi, ari bo Balewi, bazoze imbere, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabatoranije ngo bakore igikorwa c’ubuherezi bongere bahezagire mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi ni bo bategerezwa guca imanza z’amatati no gukomeretsanya. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Maze abatware b’igisagara kizoba kiri hafi y’ico kiziga bazokarabire ibiganza vyabo kuri iyo shashi bazoba bavuniye izosi kuri uwo mwonga. <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />Bazovuge bati: “Amaboko yacu ntiyasheshe amaraso y’uwu muntu, kandi ntitwabonye n’ukuntu yishwe. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, wakire iyi mpongano, ubabarire Abisirayeli wacunguye, ntubaharureko amaraso y’uwu muntu yishwe ata co azira.” Maze ayo maraso y’uwo azoba ahongewe. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Gutyo muzoba mwikuyeko icaha co gusesa amaraso y’umuntu ata co azira, kuko muzoba mwakoze ibibereye mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo kurongora uwagizwe inyagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Nimwaja kugwanya abansi banyu, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu akabatanga mu maboko yanyu mukabagira imbohe, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />hanyuma ugashima umugore umwe mu mbohe zanyu, uzomugire umugore wawe. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Uzomwinjize mu nzu yawe, yimoshe, yice inzara, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />hanyuma ahindure impuzu yari yambaye akiri imbohe, yambare izindi. Niyamara kuba mu nzu yawe, akagandarira se na nyina ukwezi kwose, uzoheze umurongore, ube umugabo wiwe na we abe umugore wawe. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Nihagera igihe ntabe akikunezera, uzomureke yigire iyo ashaka. Ntuzomugurishe canke ngo umugire umugurano, kuko wamaze kumutesha agaciro.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye no kuba samuragwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Nihagira umugabo agira abagore babiri, hanyuma agakunda umwe kurusha uwundi, bompi bakavyarana na we abahungu, ariko umuhungu wa mbere akaba uw’umugore adakundwa, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />hageze ko abagaburira itunga ryiwe, ntazogire samuragwa uwo muhungu w’umugore akundwa, samuragwa azobe uwo kuri uwo mugore adakundwa. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Ategerezwa kwemera ko umuhungu w’umugore adakundwa ari we mfura amuhe imigabane ibiri ku vyo atunze. Uwo muhungu wa mbere ni we kimenyetso c’inkomezi za se. Uburenganzira buhabwa imfura ni ubwiwe.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuhungu ananiye abavyeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Abavyeyi nibagira umwana hanyuma akaba umugarariji ntabubahe n’aho bomuhana, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />bazomuzane imbere y’abatware kw’irembo ry’igisagara. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Bazobwire abatware b’igisagara bati: “Uwu mwana wacu ni intumva kandi ni umugarariji. Ntatwumvira. Yama mu buhumbu n’akaborerwe.” <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Maze abagabo bo muri ico gisagara bose bazomwicishe amabuye. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe. Abisirayeli bose bazovyumva batinye.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amategeko atandukanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Umuntu niyagirizwa agatsindwa n’icaha gituma yicwa, azokwicwe, umuvyimba wiwe bawumanike ku giti, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />ariko uwo muvyimba ntuzorare kuri ico giti. Muzomuhambe uwo musi nyene, kuko uwumanitswe ku giti wese azoba ari musi y’umuvumo w’Imana. Gutyo muzoba mwirinze guhumanya igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi ryanyu.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Niwasanga inka canke intama y’umubanyi iriko irayerera mu gahinga, ntuze uyirengagize, uzoyigarure uyimucurire. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nyeneyo nataba aba hafi canke ukaba utamumenye, uzoyicure i muhira iwawe uyimubikire gushika aje kuyirondera, nawe uzoheze uyimuhe. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Muze mubikore ukwo no ku ndogoba yazimiye, umutamana wazimiye canke ikindi kintu cose cazimiye. Ntimuze muvyirengagize.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Niwasanga indogoba canke ishuri ya mwenewanyu yaguye ku nzira, ntuze uyirengagize, uze umufashe kuyivyura.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Umugore ntaze yambare ivyambarwa vy’igitsina gabo, kandi n’umugabo ntaze yambare ivyambarwa vy’igitsina gore. Uwukora ivyo aba akoze ikizira k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Nimwasanga icari c’inyoni ku giti, i ruhande y’inzira canke hasi, mugasanga nyina ibundikiriye abana canke amagi, ntimuzotwarane nyina n’abana. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Muzotware abana gusa, nyina muyireke, kugira ngo ivyanyu bizogende neza mukaramba.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Nimwubaka inzu nshasha, muzoyubakire agahome kayizunguruka ko hejuru kuri yo ko gutangira uwokoroka kugira ngo iyo nzu ntizoharurweko icaha co gusesa amaraso hagize uwukoroka avuye hejuru.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Ntimuze mutere ubwoko bubiri bw’imbuto mu ruzabibu rwanyu; nimwabikora, ntimuzoba muhumanije umurima gusa, ariko n’ivyamwa vyarwo na vyo bizoba bihumanye.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Ntimuzorimishe inka isangiye ingogo n’indogoba.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Ntimuzokwambare impuzu zikozwe mu nyuzi z’ubwoko bubiri butandukanye.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Umutamana wo kwipfuka muzowushireko ubushenza ku mitwe ine yawo.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutubahiriza ivyo kwabirana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Nihagira umugabo yabira umugore, amaze kuryamana na we akumva aramwanse, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />akamumaramaza mu bantu amwagiriza ko yigenjeje nabi, akavuga ati: “Igihe narongora uwu mugore nasanze ata bimenyetso vyerekana ko atigeze aryamana n’umugabo afise,” <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />abavyeyi b’uwo mugore baze bashire abakuru b’ico gisagara ivyemeza ko uwo mugore atigeze aryamana n’uwundi mugabo. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Se w’uwo mugore azobwire abatware ati: “Uwu mugabo namuhaye umukobwa wanje ngo abe umugore wiwe, ariko ubu aramwanse. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Yamumaramaje avuga ati: ‘Nasanze umukobwa wanyu atagifise ibimenyetso vyerekana ko atigeze aryamana n’uwundi mugabo.’ Ariko ng’ibi ibimenyetso bigaragaza ko umukobwa wacu atigeze aryamana n’uwundi mugabo.” Abo bavyeyi bazokwerekane impuzu yiwe imbere y’abakuru b’igisagara. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Maze abo batware b’igisagara bazoce bafata uwo mugabo bamuhane. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Baze bamucire igihano co gutanga shekeli ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilo 1,2.</char></note> z’ifeza azihe se w’umugore, kuko yamaramaje umukobwa w’Umwisirayelikazi. Azogume ari umugore wiwe, ntibaze bigere bahukana ubuzima bwabo bwose.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Ariko nibasanga ivyo umugabo avuga ari ukuri, umugore akabura ivyemeza ko yari isugi, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />azojanwe ku muryango w’inzu ya se, maze abagabo bose bo muri ico gisagara bazoce bamwicisha amabuye. Azoba yakoze ikizira mu Bisirayeli mu gusambana akiba mu nzu kwa se. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Umugabo azofatwa aryamanye n’umugore atari uwiwe, azokwicanwe n’uwo mugore basambanye. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Nihagira umugabo ahurira mu gisagara n’inkumi ikowe, hanyuma agasambana na yo, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />muzobatware bose kw’irembo ry’igisagara, mubicishe amabuye. Umugore aze yicwe kuko atakomye induru ngo atabaze kandi yari mu gisagara, umugabo na we aze yicwe kuko yafashe ku nguvu umukobwa w’abandi. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Ariko umugabo azohura n’umukobwa akowe n’uwundi ahandi atari mu gisagara akamufata ku nguvu, uwo mugabo azoba yakoze ivyo azokwicwe wenyene. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Uwo mukobwa ntihaze hagire ico mumugira, kuko ata caha azoba yakoze cotuma yicwa. Bizobe nka kurya kw’umuntu yishe mugenziwe ata co amuziza, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />kuko uwo mugabo azoba yasanze inkumi mu gahinga akayifata ku nguvu, naho yoba yarakomye induru ntiyashobora kuronka uwumutabara.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Nihagira umugabo ahura n’inkumi idakowe, akayifata ku nguvu hanyuma bagafatwa, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />uwo mugabo azohanishwe igihano co gutanga shekeli mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 575.</char></note> z’ifeza azihe se. Hanyuma ategerezwa kumurongora abe umugore wiwe, kuko yamusambanije ku nguvu. Kandi ntaze yigere avana na we igihe cose azoba akiriho.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Ntihazogire umugabo yabira umugore wa se, kuko azoba ahumanije uburiri bwa se.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Abatemerewe kuba mw’ikoraniro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Umugabo yamenetse amagara canke yaciwe igitsina ntazoje mw’ikoraniro ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Umuntu yavyawe mu buryo butemewe n’ijambo ry’Imana ntiyemerewe kuja mw’ikoraniro ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe n’abamukomokako bose, kugeza ku runganwe rugira icumi.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Nta muntu wo mu Bamoni canke Umunyamowabu, n’uruvyaro rwabo gushika ku runganwe rw’icumi yemerewe kuba mw’ikoraniro ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Abo bantu ntibabakirije ivyokurya n’amazi igihe mwariko murava muri Egiputa, ariko basavye Balamu mwene Beyori w’i Petori muri Mezopotamiya, ari ho hitwa Aramu-Naharayimu, ngo abavume. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ntiyumviye Balamu, umuvumo wiwe awuhindura umuhezagiro wanyu, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abakunda. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Ntimuzorondere kugirirana amahoro na bo imisi yose yo kubaho kwanyu.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Abanyedomu n’Abanyegiputa ntimuzobafate nk’ikizira, kuko Abanyedomu ari incuti zanyu, kandi mukaba mwarabanye n’Abanyegiputa muri abanyamahanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Abo mu runganwe rugira gatatu rwabo bazokwinjire mw’ikoraniro ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwirinda ubuhumane mw’ikambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Igihe muzoba muriko muritegurira kuja ku rugamba kugira ngo mutere abansi banyu, muzokure igihumanye cose muri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Umugabo niyahumana biciye mu gusesa imbuto mw’ijoro asinziriye, azoje inyuma y’ikambi amareyo umusi wose. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Bugira buce aze yoge hanyuma izuba rirenze agaruke mw’ikambi.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Muzotegure inyuma y’ikambi ikibanza co kwitumamwo. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Mu bikoresho muzohora mugendana, muzokwibangikanye ikimito. Mugiye kwituma, muzokwimbe akanogo, hanyuma muhejeje mufurire uwo mwanda wanyu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu agendagenda mu nsago zanyu kugira ngo abakingire yongere arekurire abansi banyu mu maboko yanyu, amakambi yanyu akwiye kuba yejejwe, kugira ngo ntazosangeho ikintu na kimwe giteye isoni, hanyuma akisubirira inyuma.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayandi mategeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Umugurano niyaguhungirako avuye mu kindi gihugu kugira ngo umukingire, ntuze umutange kuri shebuja. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Muzobareke babe muri mwebwe, aho bashatse hose no mu gisagara cose bahisemwo. Ntimuzomutwaze umukazo.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Ntihaze hagire Umwisirayeli, yaba umugore canke umugabo, aba maraya mu bibanza basengeramwo ibigirwamana. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Ntimuze mwakire mu nzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu amashikanwa yo gushitsa isezerano ashikanywe na maraya, yaba umugore canke umugabo, kuko ayo mashikanwa n’abayashikana vyose ari ibisesema k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Mwenewanyu w’Umwisirayeli, ntimuze mumwake inyungu haba ku mahera canke ku vyokurya canke ku bindi bintu vyose vyari gushobora kubazanira inyungu. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Muzokwake inyungu abanyamahanga, ariko Umwisirayeli ntimuzoyimwake, kugira ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azohezagire ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu mu gihugu mugiye kwinjira mukacegukira.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Nihagira ico musezeranira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ntimuzotevye kugishitsa, kuko mwobiharurwako nk’icaha. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Ariko nimutagira ico musezerana, ntimuzobiharurwako nk’icaha. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Ico muzosezeranisha akanwa kanyu, muzogishitse, kuko mwagisezeraniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ata wubagobereye.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Nimwinjira mu ruzabibu rwa bagenzi banyu, muzorye inzabibu mushaka zose ariko ntihagire izo muzokwamurira mu giseke ngo muzitahane. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Nimwinjira mu mirima y’ingano y’ababanyi banyu, muzoce izo mushaka zose muhekenye, ariko ntimuzogenyeshe urukero izihagaze.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Umugabo niyabira umugore hanyuma agahitamwo kuvana na we kuko yasanze hari ikintu kitari ciza gituma batoshishikara kubana, azomwandikire urwandiko rwemeza ko bavanye, arumuhe hanyuma aheze amwirukane. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Niyamara kugenda, azoba afise uburenganzira bwo kwubakana n’uwundi mugabo. <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />Ariko uwo wa kabiri na we nyene niyamwanka, akamuha urwandiko rwemeza ko bahukanye, canke uwo mugabo agapfa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />wa mugabo wa mbere ntazoba yemerewe gusubira kubana n’uwo mugore kuko azoba yarahumanijwe. Ivyo bizoba ari ikizira k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntimuze mukwegere ivyaha mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Umugabo aherutse kurongora ntazorungikwe ku rugamba, canke ngo azezwe ibindi bikorwa. Aze ahabwe akaruhuko amare umwaka wose abana n’umugore wiwe yarongoye kugira ngo amunezereze.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Ntihaze hagire uwutwara urusyo, eka naho yoba ingasiro yonyene, kw’ingwati, kuko ni nk’aho yoba atwaye ubuzima bwa nyenevyo.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Nihagira uwufatwa yanyuruje mwenewabo w’Umwisirayeli, akamugira umugurano wiwe canke akamugurisha, uwo muntu azokwicwe. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Niwagwara ingwara zihumanya zifatira ku rukoba, uze wiyubare kugira ngo ukore uko abaherezi ari bo Balewi bazokubwira. Muze mukurikize neza ivyo nabategetse. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Mwibuke ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yagiriye Miriyamu muri mu rugendo muva muri Egiputa.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Nimwaha ingurane umubanyi, ntimuze mwinjire mu nzu y’uwo mwaguranye gutora ico yatanze nk’ingwati. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Muze mugume hanze mureke uwo mubanyi yinjire wenyene, abe ari we ayibazanira hanze. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Nimba uwo mubanyi ari umukene, akaguha umutamana wiwe nk’ingwati ntuzoryame utarawumusubiza. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Uzomusubize umutamana wiwe izuba ritararenga, kuko ashobora kuba ata wundi afise yipfuka. Azobigushimira kandi uzobiharurwako nk’ukugororoka mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Ntimuze muhahaze umukozi ngo ni uko ari umworo kandi akenye, yaba mwenewanyu w’Umwisirayeli canke umunyamahanga aba muri kimwe mu bisagara vyanyu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Muzomuhe impembo abereye izuba ritararenga kuko ari umukene, kandi akaba ari yo imubeshejeho. Bitabaye uko, azoririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarega, na we abibaharureko nk’icaha.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Ntihaze hagire umuvyeyi yicwa azira abana biwe, canke abana ngo bicwe bazira abavyeyi babo, umwe wese azozire ivyaha vyiwe.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Muze mucire izibereye abanyamahanga hamwe n’impfuvyi baba muri mwebwe, kandi ntimuze mutware umutamana w’umupfakazi kw’ingwati. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Mwibuke ko mwabaye abagurano muri Egiputa, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu akabarokora. Ni co gituma ndabategeka ivyo.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Igihe muzoba muriko murimbura ingano mu mirima yanyu, hanyuma hakagira umukama murengana, ntimuze musubire inyuma kuwutora, muze muzirekere ba kavantara, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi, kugira ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azohezagire ibikorwa vy’intoke zanyu. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Nimwaja kwamura imyelayo, ntimuzokubite ishami kabiri. Muzokubite rimwe, iyisigayeko muzoyirekere abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Nimwimbura inzabibu, ntimuze musubireyo. Izisigaye mu mirima muze muzirekere abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Mwibuke ko mwabaye abagurano muri Egiputa. Ni co gituma ndabategetse ivyo.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Abantu babiri nibagira ico bapfa, baze bashire urubanza rwabo abacamanza, na bo baruce, batunganirize uwutaco yagirizwa, uwo icaha cagiriye ahanwe. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Nimba uwatsinzwe n’icaha aciriwe urubanza rwo gukubitwa, abacamanza bazomuryamike hasi bamukubitishe imbere yabo, akubitwe izihwanye n’icaha camwagiriye, <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />ariko ntazokubitwe izirenga mirongo ine. Niyakubitwa izirenga mirongo ine, Umwisirayeli mwenewanyu azoba ateterejwe mu maso yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Ntimuze mwugare umunwa w’inka iriko irasekura ingano.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Abahungu bavukana nibaba babana hanyuma umwe agapfa atavyaye umuhungu, umugore asize ntazorongorwe mu wundi muryango. Mwenewabo n’umugabo wiwe azomutware abe umugore wiwe, amukorere ivyo muramu w’umuntu abwirizwa kumukorera. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Umuhungu wa mbere azovyara azokwitwe izina ry’uwo mwenewabo yapfuye, kugira ngo izina ryiwe ntiryibagirwe muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Ariko natagomba kurongora uwo mugore yasizwe na mwenewabo, uwo mugore azoce aja kw’irembo ry’igisagara abarire abatware ati: “Mwenewabo n’umugabo wanje yanse gukomeza izina rya mwenewabo muri Isirayeli. Yanse kunkorera ivyo muramu w’umuntu abwirizwa kumukorera.” <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Maze abatware b’igisagara abamwo bazoce bamuhamagaza, babimubaze. Niyashishikara avuga ati: “Sinshaka kumucura,” <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />wa mupfakazi azoce amwegera, imbere y’abatware, amwambure ikirato kimwe, amucire amate mu maso, avuge ati: “Uko ni ko uwanse gukomeza umuryango wa mwenewabo agirirwa.” <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Umuryango w’uwo mugabo uzomenyekane mu Bisirayeli witwe umuryango w’Uwambuwe ikirato.<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Abagabo babiri b’Abisirayeli nibaba bariko baragwana, hanyuma umugore w’umwe muri abo akaza kumutabara, hanyuma agafata amagara y’uwo agwana n’umugabo wiwe, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />muze mumuce ukuboko. Ntimuze mumugirire impuhwe.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Ntimuzogire amabuye abiri atandukanye y’umunzane mw’isaho imwe, rimwe rikwije ibilo n’irindi ridakwije. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Ntimuzogire imetero zibiri mu nzu zanyu, imwe ikwiye n’iyindi idakwiye. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Muzogire umunzane n’imetero bikwiye kandi vy’ukuri kugira ngo muzorambire mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yanka uwukora bene ivyo, yanka uwufise ubugunge mu rudandazwa wese.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Mwibuke ivyo Abamaleki babagiriye muri mu rugendo muva muri Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Babateye babaciye inyuma, igihe mwari murushe, mwadendebukiwe, bica abari bagikwega amaguru inyuma, kuko batari bafise ukwubaha Imana muri bo. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu niyamara kubaha akaruhuko mu gihugu abahaye nk’iragi, muzorandure Abamaleki bibagirwe musi y’ijuru.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyeze ubwa mbere n’ibigiracumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Nimwamara kwinjira mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye nk’iragi, mukacegukira mukakibamwo, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />muze mufate ku vyeze vya mbere mwimbuye mu mirima yanyu yo mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahaye, mubishire mu giseke. Hanyuma muze mubijane muri ca kibanza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yaratoranije, aho Izina ryayo rizohimbarizwa <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />hanyuma mubwire umuherezi azoba ariko akora ico gikorwa c’ubuherezi ico gihe muti: “Ndemeje uno musi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe ko nashitse mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahiye ba sogokuruza ko azokiduha.” <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Umuherezi azokwakira ico giseke, agitereke imbere y’igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Maze muze muvugire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu muti: “Sogokuruza wacu Yakobo yari Umwaramu atagira aho aba hanyuma amanuka muri Egiputa ajanye n’abantu bakeya, hanyuma baragwira baba ihanga rinini kandi rikomeye. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Ariko Abanyegiputa baraducinyiza, baratubabaza, batugira abagurano babo. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Maze dutakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza, na we yumva ugutakamba kwacu, abona amagorwa yacu, imiruho n’agacinyizo twarimwo. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> adukura muri Egiputa n’ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi kandi kuramvuye, n’ibiteye ubwoba vyinshi, hamwe n’ibitangaza n’utwumiza. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Yatuzanye muri kino kibanza, aduha kino gihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki, <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />none rero, nshikanye ivyeze vya mbere vyo mu mirima wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wampaye.” Muce mutereka ico giseke imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu hanyuma mwikubite imbere yayo muyipfukamire. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Hanyuma, mwe n’Abalewi n’abanyamahanga baba hagati muri mwebwe, muze muce munezerwa muhimbaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, munezererwe ivyo azoba yabahaye mwe n’abo mu nzu zanyu.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Niwamara gushira ku ruhande ikigiracumi c’ivyo wimbuye mu mwaka ugira gatatu, ari wo mwaka w’ikigiracumi, uze ugihe Abalewi, abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi, kugira ngo na bo baronke ivyo barya bahagire mu bisagara vyanyu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Muze mwongere mubwire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu muti: “Nakuye mu nzu yanje umuce watoranijwe, ndawuha Abalewi, abanyamahanga, impfuvyi n’abapfakazi, nk’uko wabidutegetse. Sinaciye i ruhande ngo nyuranye n’amabwirizwa yawe, sinibagiye na rimwe muri yo. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Sinariye umuce watoranijwe igihe nari ngandaye, canke ngo ngire ico ndawukurako igihe nari ngihumanye, canke ngo nkureko ivyo nshikanira abapfuye. Nagamburukiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje, nakoze ivyo wantegetse vyose. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />None rero, undabe uri mw’ijuru, ahera hawe, uhezagire abantu bawe ba Isirayeli, hamwe n’igihugu wari wasezeraniye ba sogokuruza bacu ko uzokiduha, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gukurikiza amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abategetse gukurikiza aya mabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe, muzovyubahe n’imitima yanyu yose, n’imishaha yanyu yose. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Mwemeje uwu musi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari yo Mana yanyu, kandi ko muzogendera mu nzira ziwe, mukazigama amabwirizwa, amategeko n’ivyagezwe vyiwe, kandi ko muzomwubaha. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we, uwu musi yemeje ko muri abantu biwe, itunga yiharije nk’uko yabisezeranye, kandi ko mutegerezwa kuzokwama mugendera mu vyagezwe vyiwe. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Nimwabikurikiza, azobashira hejuru y’ayandi mahanga yose yaremye. Abandi bazobashimagiza, babubahe, mumenyekane mu mahanga. Muzoba ihanga ryera ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, nk’uko yabisezeranye.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Igicaniro co ku musozi Ebalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Mose n’abatware b’Abisirayeli bategeka abantu bati: “Muze muzigame amabwirizwa yose ndabahaye uno musi. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Nimwajabuka Yorodani mugashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, muze muhagarike amabuye maninimanini, muyasige ishwagara. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Hanyuma, igihe muzoba mumaze kujabuka, mugashika mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza yabibasezeraniye, muze muyandikeko amajambo yose y’ibi Vyagezwe. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Kandi, nimwamara kujabuka Yorodani, ayo mabuye muze muyashinge ku musozi Ebalu, nk’uko ndabibategetse uno musi, muyasige ishwagara. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Muze muhubakire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu igicaniro, mucubake mu mabuye. Ntimuze muyabazishe ivyuma. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Muze mwubake igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mucubakishe amabuye yo mu gahinga, mugishikanireko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu amashikanwa yo guturirwa. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Muze muhashikanire amashikanwa y’ishimwe, murye mwongere muhimbarirwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Muze mwandike mu ndome zisomeka amajambo y’ibi Vyagezwe kuri ayo mabuye muzoba mwashinze.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imivumo yo ku musozi Ebalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Mose n’abaherezi, ari bo Balewi, baca babwira Abisirayeli bati: “Yemwe Bisirayeli, nimucereze mwumvirize! Uwu musi mubaye ubwoko bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Mwubahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukurikize amategeko n’ivyagezwe vyiwe, ndabahaye uno musi.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Uwo musi nyene Mose aca aha abantu ayo mabwirizwa, avuga ati:<verse eid="DEU 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Nimwamara kujabuka Yorodani, iyi miryango izoje ku musozi Gerizimu bature ku bantu imihezagiro: umuryango wa Simeyoni, uwa Lewi, uwa Yuda, uwa Isakari, uwa Yosefu, n’uwa Benyamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Iyi ikurikira na yo izohagarare ku musozi Ebalu yature imivumo: umuryango wa Reyubeni, uwa Gadi, uwa Asheri, uwa Zebuloni, uwa Dani n’uwa Nafutali.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Abalewi baze basemerere n’ijwi rirenga, babwire Abisirayeli bose bati:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />‘Haravumwe umuntu azokwibazira ikigirwamana, ikintu gisesema <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; igikorwa c’amaboko y’umucuzi, akagishinga mu mpisho.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:15">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati: ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />‘Haravumwe umuntu atubaha se na nyina.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:16">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />‘Haravumwe umuntu ashingura akarimbi k’umubanyi wiwe.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:17">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />‘Haravumwe umuntu azimiza impumyi.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:18">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />‘Haravumwe umuntu adacira urubanza rugororotse umunyamahanga, impfuvyi n’umupfakazi.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:19">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />‘Haravumwe umuntu aryamana n’umugore wa se, kuko aba ahumanije uburiri bwa se.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:20">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />‘Haravumwe umuntu asambana n’igikoko ico ari co cose.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:21">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />‘Haravumwe umuntu aryamana na mushikiwe, umwana wa se canke wa nyina.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:22">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />‘Haravumwe umuntu asambana na inabukwe’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:23">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />‘Haravumwe umuntu yica umubanyi wiwe yihishije.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:24">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />‘Haravumwe umuntu yakira ingero yo kwica umuntu ata co azira.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:25">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />‘Haravumwe umuntu adakurikiza ibi Vyagezwe, ntashire mu ngiro ico bivuga.’</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:26">Maze abantu bose bazokwishure bati ‘Amen!’<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Imihezagiro ku bumvira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Nimwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, n’imitima yanyu yose, mugakurikiza amabwirizwa yiwe ndabahaye uwu musi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobashira hejuru y’ayandi mahanga yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Nimwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ng’iyi imihezagiro izobakurikira:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Muzogira imihezagiro mu bisagara no mu matongo.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Abana banyu, imirima yanyu n’ibitungwa vyanyu bizohezagirwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Ibiseke vyanyu n’amato yanyu mucumbiramwo bizohezagirwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Muzohezagirwa amaja n’amaza.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobaha kunesha abansi bazobahagurukira ngo babatere. Bazobatera bazananye inzira imwe, basubire inyuma bajanye inzira indwi.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohezagira ibigega vyanyu, n’ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu vyose. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azohezagira igihugu abahaye.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobagira ihanga ryera nk’uko yabisezeranishije indahiro, nimwakurikiza amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukagendera mu nzira ziwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Ni ho ayandi mahanga yo kw’isi yose azomenya ko mwitirirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze abatinye. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobasesekariza ivyiza mu gihugu yarahiye ba sogokuruza ko azokibaha, abagwirize uruvyaro, ibitungwa n’ivyimburwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobugururira ubutunzi bwiwe butangaje bwo mw’ijuru, abarungikire imvura igihe kibereye, ahezagire n’ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu. Amahanga azobasaba ingurane ariko mwebwe nta we muzosaba ingurane. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobagira umutwe, ntazobagira umurizo. Nimwitondera amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ndabahaye uwu musi, mukayakurikiza neza yose, muzokwama muri hejuru y’abandi, ntimuzigera muja musi yabo. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Ntihaze hagire ibwirizwa na rimwe mwirengagiza mu yo ndabahaye uno musi, canke ngo muhengamire i buryo canke i bubamfu, canke ngo mukurikire izindi mana canke ngo muzikorere.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imivumo ku batumvira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Ariko nimutubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ntimukurikize amabwirizwa n’amategeko ndabahaye uwu musi, ng’iyi imivumo izobakurikira:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Muzovumwa mu bisagara no mu matongo.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Ibiseke n’amato yanyu muganiramwo bizovumwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Abana banyu bazovumwa, imirima yanyu izovumwa, n’ibitungwa vyanyu bizovumwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Muzovumwa mugenda, muvumwe mugaruka.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobarungikira umuvumo, abatere kuzazanirwa, avume igikorwa cose muzokora kugeza murandurwe mugahera kubera ikibi muzoba mwakoze mu kumuvako. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobarungikamwo icago c’ingwara gushika mutikiriye mu gihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo ngo mucegukire. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobakubitisha ingwara yo kubora mu magufa, ibatere umururumbo n’ibiturika, mugende mwuma mu magara, uruzuba n’ubugaragwa, ururyi no kurumvya bizobahwikira kugeza muherengeteye. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Hejuru yanyu, ijuru rizobamerera nk’ubutare bwitwa umuringa, isi na yo musi y’ibirenge vyanyu ibamerere nk’icuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azorungika umusenyi n’umukungugu mu gishingo c’imvura, bizogwa gushika murandutse.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotuma muneshwa n’abansi banyu. Muzobatera mujanye inzira imwe, mubahunge muciye mu nzira indwi. Muzoba muri ibicibwa imbere y’ubwami bwose bwo kw’isi. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Imivyimba yanyu izoba inyama z’ibisiga vyo mu kirere n’iz’ibikoko vyo kw’isi, kandi nta n’uwuzovyamira. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobateza ibihute nk’ivyo yateje Egiputa, abatere ibivyimba, ibisebe n’urukushi bidakira. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobababarisha ibisazi, ubuhumyi, n’ukuzazanirwa mu bwenge bwanyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Ku murango muzozimagirika nk’impumyi yama mu mwijima. Ivyo muzokora vyose nta na kimwe kizogenda neza, muzocinyizwa umusi ku wundi, musahurwe utwanyu ata gitabara.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Muzokwa abageni, ariko batwarwe n’abandi, babarongore ku nguvu. Muzokwubaka amazu, ariko ntimuzoyabamwo. Muzotera inzabibu, ariko ntimuzorya ivyamwa vyazo. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Inka zanyu zizobagirwa mu maso yanyu, ariko nta n’imwe muzoryako. Indogoba zanyu muzozakwa ku nguvu kandi ntimuzozisubizwa. Intama zanyu zizohabwa abansi banyu, kandi nta wuzobatabara. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Abahungu banyu n’abakobwa banyu bazotwarwa mu mahanga nk’abaja, kandi amaso yanyu azokoboka muriko mubiraba umusi ku wundi, ata co mushobora gukora. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Abantu mutigeze mumenya bazorya ivyimburwa mwabiriye akuya, kandi nta co muzohembwa atari agacinyizo katavugwa ukubaho kwanyu kwose. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Ivyo muzobonesha amaso yanyu bizobatera gusara. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobateza ibihute bidakira ku mavi no ku maguru, bizova mu bworo bw’ikirenge bishike ku mutwe.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobirukanana n’umwami mwiyimikiye, muje mu gihugu na ba sogokuruza banyu batigeze bamenya. Ni ho muzosengera imana zibajwe mu biti no mu mabuye. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Muzoba nk’ibicibwa, mucike umugani, mushinyagurizwe n’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yabashwiragirijemwo.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Muzobiba vyinshi mwimbure bike kuko inzige zizoba zabiriye. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Muzotera imizabibu muyibagarire ariko ntimuzonywa umuvinyu, nta n’inzabibu muzosoroma kuko inyo zizoba zaziriye. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Igihugu canyu kizoba cuzuye ibiti vy’imyelayo, ariko ntimuzigera mukoresha amavuta, kuko imyelayo izoba yarahungurutse. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Muzovyara abahungu n’abakobwa ariko ntimuzobarera, kuko bazoca batwarwa mu buja. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Inzige zizotikiza ibiti vyose vyo mu gihugu canyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Abanyamahanga baba muri mwebwe bazogenda bashirwa hejuru, namwe mugende mucishwa bugufi. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Bazobagurana, ariko mwebwe ntimuzobagurana. Bazoba umutwe, namwe mube umurizo.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Iyi mivumo yose izobashikako. Izobakurikirana ibafate, gushika muherengeteye, kuko muzoba mutubashe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ntimukurikize amabwirizwa n’amategeko yabahaye. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Izoba ibitangaza n’utwumiza kuri mwebwe no ku ruvyaro rwanyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Kuko mutazoba mwakoreye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu munezerewe n’imitima ibikunze mugifise umusesekara mu gihe c’iterambere, <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />ni co gituma muzokorera abansi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobarungikira kubagwanya mufise inzara, inyota, mwambaye ubusa, muri mu bukene butavugwa. Bazobashira mu buja kugeza babaranduye.<verse eid="DEU 28:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobagomorerako ihanga ribatere rivuye kure, ku mpera y’isi, baze nk’inkukuma yirasa kw’isi gufata ico irya, ihanga rivuga ururimi mutazi, <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />ihanga riteye ubwoba, ritubaha uwushaje canke ngo rigirire impuhwe uwukiri muto. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Bazorya ibitungwa vyanyu n’ibiterwa vyanyu gushika muherengeteye. Nta ngano bazobasigira, nta muvinyu musha canke amavuta ya Elayo, nta nyana z’ibitungwa canke imyagazi y’imikuku yanyu gushika biherengeteye vyose. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Bazokwugariza ibisagara vyo mu gihugu canyu, gushika aho n’inzitiro zikomeye mwishimiye zihomvokera hasi. Bazokwugariza ibisagara vyose vyo mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Kubera imibabaro abansi banyu bazobateza mu gihe co kwugarizwa, muzorya abana banyu, murye inyama z’abahungu n’abakobwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yarabahaye. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />N’umugabo w’inyankamugayo wo muri mwebwe ntazogirira imbabazi mwenewabo canke umugore wiwe akunda, canke abana biwe, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />ntazobahako na gatoya ku nyama z’abana biwe azoba ariko ararya. Nta kindi azoba asigaranye, kubera amagorwa abansi banyu bazoba babateye mu gihe bazoba bugarije ibisagara vyanyu vyose. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Umugore w’umutima kandi w’inyankamugayo rwose muri mwebwe, ku buryo yiyubara no gukandagira kw’isi azogunga umugabo yakunda n’umuhungu wiwe n’umukobwa wiwe <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />abime ku ngovyi y’abana avyaye, kuko azoba agomba kuyirya wenyene yinyegeje mu gihe muzoba muri mu mibabaro abansi banyu bazobateza mu kwugariza ibisagara vyanyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Nimutakurikiza amajambo yose y’ibi Vyagezwe, yanditswe muri iki gitabu, kandi ngo mwubahe iri zina ryiwe ryiza kandi rihambaye ari ryo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azorungika ivyago biteye ubwoba kuri mwebwe no ku ruvyaro rwanyu. Ivyo vyago bizoba bikomeye, mubure agahengekerezo, mugwaye ingwara zidakira. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Azobateza za ngwara zo muri Egiputa mwatinya, kandi zizobomako. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobashitsako n’ingwara n’ivyago bindi bitanditswe muri iki Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe, gushika muherengeteye. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Naho mwagwiriye mukangana n’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru, muzosigara muri inkehwa, kuko mwanse kwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyamuhimbara kubateza imbere no kubagwiza, ni ko bizomuhimbara kubakokora no kubarandura. Muzorandurwa mu gihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo ngo mucegukire.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobasanzaza mu mahanga yose, uhereye ku mpera imwe y’isi ugashitsa ku yindi. Ni ho muzosenga imana zabajwe mu biti no mu mabuye, izo mwe na ba sogokuruza banyu mutigeze mubona. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Muri ayo mahanga ntimuzigera muronka akaruhuko, canke aho mushinga ikirenge mutekaniwe. Aho muzoba muri muri ayo mahanga, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobateza guhagarika imitima, amaso yanyu ajemwo uruhumyi, imitima yanyu idendebukirwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Ubuzima bwanyu buzomera nk’aho ata bwo mugira, mwame mwuzuye ubwoba bw’urupfu ku murango no mw’ijoro, mwumva ko ata cizere ca kazoza mufise. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Mu gatondo muzovuga muti: ‘Ese twobona burije!’ Mw’ijoro na ho muvuge muti: ‘Ese twobona burakeye!’ Kuko muzoterwa ubwoba n’ivyo amaso yanyu azobona. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobasubiza muri Egiputa muri mu bwato, urugendo nabihanikirije nti ntimuzosubire kurufata. Ni ho muzokwidandaza mwebwe nyene ku bansi banyu nk’abagurano n’abaguranokazi, ariko nta n’umwe azobagura.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">Gusubira mw’isezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Aya ni yo majambo y’isezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye Mose ngo asezerane n’Abisirayeli mu gihugu c’i Mowabu, isezerano ryiyongera ku ryo yari yaragiranye na bo ku musozi Horebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Mose akoranya Abisirayeli bose, arababwira ati: “Amaso yanyu yariboneye ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoze muri Egiputa, abikoreye Farawo, abatware biwe n’igihugu cose.<verse eid="DEU 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Amaso yanyu yariboneye ivyo bigeragezo bikomeye, ivyo bimenyetso n’ivyo bitangaza. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Ariko gushika uno musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyabahaye ubwenge butahura, amaso abona canke amatwi yumva. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Mu myaka mirongo ine nabarongoye mu bugaragwa, impuzu zanyu n’ibirato vyanyu ntivyigeze bishira. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Nta mukate mwariye, nta muvinyu canke ibindi binyobwa bituriranije mwanyoye. Ivyo nabibakoreye kugira ngo mumenye ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Igihe mwashika muri iki gihugu, Sihoni umwami wa Heshiboni na Ogi umwami w’i Bashani baje kubatera, ariko turabanesha. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Twafashe igihugu cabo tugiha umuryango wa Reyubeni nk’iragi ryawo, uwa Gadi hamwe n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase.<verse eid="DEU 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />None rero muzokwitondere ibigize iri sezerano kugira ngo muzotere imbere mu vyo muzokora vyose. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Mwese muhagaze ngaha imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu: abakuru b’imiryango, abatware, namwe bagabo b’Abisirayeli mwese, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />muri kumwe n’abana banyu, abagore banyu, muri kumwe kandi n’abanyamahanga baba mu makambi yanyu, babasenyera bakabavomera. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Muhagaze ngaha kugira ngo mugiranire isezerano n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu; iryo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira agirane namwe uwu musi arishigikije indahiro, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />kugira ngo abagire abantu biwe, na we abe Imana yanyu nk’uko yabirahiye ba sogokuruza banyu Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Iri sezerano rishigikijwe indahiro sindarigiranye namwe muhagararanye natwe hano uwu musi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu gusa, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />ariko ndarigiranye n’urundi runganwe rutari hano uwu musi.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Ubwanyu murazi ingene twabaye muri Egiputa n’ukuntu twarenganye ibihugu vyinshi kugira ngo dushike hano. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwarabonye ibishushanyo vyabo biteye isoni, ibigirwamana vyabo bibajwe mu biti no mu mabuye hamwe n’ibicuzwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Muze mwirinde ntihaze hagire umugabo, umugore, inzu canke umuryango n’umwe wo muri mwebwe uzokura umutima k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ngo basenge imana z’ayo mahanga. Muze mwirinde ntihaze hagire umuzi umera ukazana imbuto irura y’uburozi.<verse eid="DEU 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Abumvise amajambo y’iyi ndahiro, ntimuzopfe kwiyaturako iyo migisha muvuga muti: ‘Tuzoba impore n’aho twokwigumira mu nzira zacu.’ Ivyo bizozanira guhona isi ibomvye co kimwe n’iyumye. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntazobababarira, uburake bwiwe n’ishaka ryiwe bizobaziriringira. Imivumo yose yanditswe muri iki gitabu izobakurikirana, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azozimanganya amazina yabo musi y’ijuru. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobatandukanya n’iyindi miryango y’Abisirayeli, abarundeko imivumo yose iri mw’isezerano riri muri iki gitabu c’Ivyagezwe.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Uruvyaro rwanyu ruzokwaruka mu nyuma hamwe n’abanyamahanga bazoza bavuye mu bihugu vya kure bazobona ivyago vyashikiye igihugu canyu n’ingwara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagiteje. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Igihugu canyu cose kizoba nk’ikiyigira gitongojwe umunyu n’ibizuku, nta kizosubira kuhaterwa, nta kizomera, nta bizosubira kuhakura. Hazoba agatikizo nk’akabaye i Sodomu, n’i Gomora, Adima na Zeboyimu, ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yasutseko uburake bwiwe. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Amahanga yose azobaza ati: ‘Ni kubera iki <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye ibi iki gihugu? Ni kubera iki yagisutseko ubu burake bw’inkazi?’<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Abantu bazokwishura bati: ‘Ni kubera abantu bataye isezerano ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza, isezerano yabagiriye igihe yabakura muri Egiputa. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Barayitaye basenga izindi mana, barazunamira, imana batari bwigere babona, imana zitari zivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ni co catumye uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bururumbira iki gihugu, maze agishitsako imivumo yose yanditse muri iki gitabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabaranduranye uburake bwinshi, abakura mu gihugu cabo, abirukanira mu kindi gihugu iyo bari gushika n’ubu.’<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Ibikiri mw’ibanga ni ivy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, ariko ibintu bimaze guhishurwa ni ivyacu hamwe n’abana bacu ibihe vyose, kugira ngo dukurikize amajambo y’ibi Vyagezwe.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Kwihana no kubabarirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Iyi migisha n’iyi mivumo yose nshize imbere yanyu niyamara kubashikako muri mu bihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoba yarabashwiragijemwo, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />hanyuma mwe n’abana banyu mukagaruka k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mukamwubahisha imitima yanyu n’imishaha yanyu yose mu gukora ivyo ndababwiye vyose uwu musi, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />ico gihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azokwongera abiyegereze, abagirire impuhwe abagarukane abakuye mu mahanga azoba yarabashwiragijemwo. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Naho muzoba mwarasabagiriye mu mahanga ya kure ku mpera z’isi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azobegeranya abagarukane. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />Azobasubiza mu gihugu ca ba sogokuruza, musubire mucegukire. Azobaha kwongera gutera imbere no kuba benshi kurusha ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azokeba imitima yanyu n’iy’uruvyaro rwanyu, kugira ngo mumukunde n’imitima yanyu yose, n’imishaha yanyu yose, mubone kubaho. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azoshira iyi mivumo ku bansi banyu, babanka bakongera bakabahama. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Muzosubira kwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mukurikize aya mabwirizwa ndabahaye uwu musi. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu na we azoteza imbere ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu, agwize uruvyaro rwanyu, agwize ibitungwa vyanyu, agwize n’umwimbu wanyu. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosubira abateze imbere, abanezerererwe nk’uko yanezerererwa ba sogokuruza banyu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />nimwamwumvira mukagendera mu vyagezwe vyiwe, vyanditswe muri iki Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe, mukagaruka k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu n’imitima yanyu yose n’imishaha yanyu yose.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uguhitamwo ubugingo canke urupfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Amabwirizwa ndabahaye uno musi ntagoye gutahura, kandi ntari aho mudashobora gushika. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Ntanyegejwe mw’ijuru aho mwovuga muti: ‘Ni nde yoduga mw’ijuru akaja kuyatuzanira no kuyatubwira hanyuma tukabona kuyakurikiza?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Kandi ntabitswe hakurya y’ikiyaga, aho mwogira muti: ‘Ni nde yojabuka ikiyaga akaja kuyatuzanira no kuyatubwira hanyuma tukabona kuyakurikiza?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Haba na mba, ijambo riri hafi yawe; riri mu kanwa kawe no ku mutima wawe kugira ngo ushobore kuryumvira.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Ehe raba, uwu musi nshize imbere yanyu ubuzima n’imigisha, urupfu no kuranduka. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Uwu musi ndabahaye ibwirizwa ryo gukunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, kugendera mu nzira zayo, no kuzigama amabwirizwa, amategeko n’ivyagezwe vyiwe; ni ho muzobaho, mukagwira, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu akabahezagirira mu gihugu mugiye kwinjira ngo mucegukire.<verse eid="DEU 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Ariko imitima yanyu niyava ku Mana ntimuyumvire, canke naho nimwahindukira mukunamira izindi mana mukazisenga, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />uwu musi ndababwije ukuri ko muzorandurwa. Ntimuzorambira mu gihugu mugira mujabuke Yorodani ngo mucinjiremwo mugifate.<verse eid="DEU 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Uwu musi ntoye ijuru n’isi nk’ivyabona, ko nshize imbere yanyu ubuzima n’imigisha, urupfu no kuranduka. Rero nimuhitemwo ubuzima kugira ngo mwe n’abana banyu mushobore kubaho, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />mu gukunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mu kumwumvira, no mu kwifatanya na we. Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we buzima bwanyu, azobaha kurambira mu gihugu yarahiye ko azoha ba sogokuruza Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yosuwa atoranywa ngo asubirire Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Mose yongera abwira Abisirayeli ati: <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />“Ehe raba maze imyaka ijana na mirongo ibiri, singishoboye kubarongora. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye ati: ‘Ntuzojabuka Yorodani.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ubwiwe azobagendera imbere. Azorandura amahanga yose ariyo, maze namwe mubanyage igihugu cabo. Yosuwa azobajabukana nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabisezeranye. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azogirira ayo mahanga nk’uko yagiriye Sihoni na Ogi abami b’Abamori, abo yaranduranye n’igihugu cabo. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobarekurira mu maboko yanyu, maze namwe muzobagire nk’uko yabategetse. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mushikame, mushire ubwoba. Ntimuzotinye ngo mucike intege kubera ayo mahanga, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu azojana namwe. Ntazobaheba, ntazobata.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Maze Mose ahamagara Yosuwa, ahagarara imbere y’Abisirayeli, amubwira ati: “Shikama ushire ubwoba, kuko ari wewe uzotwara ubu bwoko mu gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahiye ba sekuruza babo ko azokibaha, kandi uzokibagaburire nk’iragi. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene azogendera imbere yanyu. Ntazobata, ntazobaheba. Ntutinye kandi ntucike intege.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basomera abantu Ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Nuko Mose yandika ivyo Vyagezwe vyose mu gitabu, abiha abaherezi, ari bo bahungu ba Lewi, barerura Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, agiha n’abatware b’Abisirayeli bose. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Maze Mose ababarira ati: “Ku mpera y’umwaka wose ugira indwi, ari wo mwaka wo guheberanira imyenda, mu misi mikuru y’insago, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />mu gihe Abisirayeli bazoba bakoraniye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu mu kibanza azoba yaratoranije, muzosomere imbere y’Abisirayeli bose ibi Vyagezwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Muzobakoranye bose: abagabo, abagore, abana n’abanyamahanga bazoba baba mu bisagara vyanyu, kugira ngo bumvirize bongere bige gutinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana bifatanije no kuyubaha, bongere bitondere aya majambo yose y’ibi Vyagezwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Abana babo batazi ibi vyagezwe bazovyumvirize bongere bige gutinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu bifatanije no kuyubaha. Muzokwame mugenza gutyo ibihe vyose muzoba muri ico gihugu mugiye kujabuka Yorodani ngo mucinjire.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli baburirwa ingene bazogarariza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: “Igihe cawe co gupfa kirageze. Hamagara Yosuwa muzanane mw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, kugira ngo ndamushikirize igikorwa.” Nuko Mose ajana na Yosuwa, binjira mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro.<verse eid="DEU 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza mu nkingi y’igicu, ahagarara mu rwinjiriro rw’Ihema. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: “Ugiye kuruhuka, uhamvye ba sogokuruza. Niwamara kugenda, aba bantu bazokwigenza nka maraya mu kuja gusenga imana z’inyamahanga, imana zo muri iki gihugu bagira binjiremwo. Bazonta, barenge kw’isezerano nabagiriye. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Nanje uburake buzobaziriringira ndabate, ndabanyegeze mu nyonga hanje, kandi bazorandurwa. Ivyago vyinshi n’amagorwa menshi bizobashikako, kandi ico gihe bazovuga bati: ‘Ubwo ibi vyago ntibiriko bidushikako kuko Imana itari kumwe natwe?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Ico gihe nanje koko nzobanyegeza mu nyonga hanje kubera ikibi bazoba bakoze mu guhindukirira izindi mana bakazisenga.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />None rero niwandike aya majambo y’iyi ndirimbo, uyibigishe bayiririmbe, kugira ngo izombere icabona ku bwoko bw’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Kuko ninamara kubazana mu gihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki, igihugu nasezeranishije indahiro ba sogokuruza, bazotunga, barye, bahage, bavyibuhe. Ariko bazohindukira, basenge izindi mana, bante, barenge isezerano ryanje. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Ivyago n’amagorwa nivyabashikako, iyi ndirimbo izobabera icabona, kuko ntizokwigera yibagirwa mu ruvyaro rwabo. N’imbere y’uko ndabashikana mu gihugu nabasezeraniye ndahiye, ndazi ivyo biteguriye kuzokora.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Maze Mose yandika iyo ndirimbo aca ayigisha Abisirayeli kuri uwo musi nyene.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa mwene Nuni ati: “Shikama ushire ubwoba, kuko ari wewe ugiye gushikana Abisirayeli mu gihugu nabasezeraniye ndahiye, kandi nanje ubwanje nzoba ndi kumwe nawe.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Mose amaze kwandika Ivyagezwe vyose mu gitabu, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />aca aha icagezwe Abalewi barerura Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Akira iki Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe mugishire i ruhande y’Isandugu y’Isezerano, ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Kizokwame ngaho nk’icabona kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Kuko ndazi ko muri ubwoko bw’abagarariji n’intagondwa. Nimba mwagararije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nkiri kumwe namwe, mbega ntimuzorushiriza kugarariza ninamara gupfa? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Nimunkoranirize abakuru b’imiryango yose hamwe n’abatware banyu kugira ngo aya majambo yose ndayavuge bumva, nongere ntore n’isi n’ijuru nk’ivyabona kuri bo. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Kuko nzi neza ko ninamara gupfa muzokwononekara, mukava mu nzira nabategetse gucamwo. Mu bihe bizoza, ivyago bizobagwako kuko muzoba mwakoze ibibi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu bikamutera kuraka.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo ya Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Maze Mose asubiramwo amajambo y’iyo ndirimbo n’ijwi ryumvikana, kuva ku ntango gushika ku mpera, ikoraniro ry’Abisirayeli ryose ryumva, ati:<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Umviriza mwa majuru mwe, ngira mvuge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">umviriza wa si we, amajambo y’akanwa kanje.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Inyigisho zanje nizibagweko nk’imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">n’ijambo ryanje rimanuke nk’ikime.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Amajambo yanje abamanukire nk’imvura igwa ku vyatsi bitotahaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">canke ikime kigwa ku vyatsi.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Nzomenyekanisha izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">nshimagize ubukuru bw’Imana yacu!<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Ni urutare, ibikorwa vyiwe biratunganye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">kandi inzira ziwe ziragororotse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Ni Imana yo kwizigirwa izira ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">iragororotse, ica izibereye.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Ariko ntibakiri abana bayo kuko bayihemukiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">ni urunganwe rw’abanyakibi, bagoramye.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Mbega mwa Bisirayeli b’ibipfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">ukwo ni ko musubirije mu nkoko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Mbega si sowanyu, Umuremyi wanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">yabaremye, yababumvye?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Kubitiza agatima ku misi ya kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">mwibuke urunganwe rwarenganye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Baza ba sogokuruza banyu bazobabwira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">musiguze abakurambere banyu na bo bazobasigurira.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Igihe Iyisumbavyose yagaburira abantu ibihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">igihe yagabura abantu ku moko yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">yabashingiye akarimbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">ikurikije igitigiri c’abahungu ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Kuko Abisirayeli ari bo mugabane w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakobo na we akaba ari we ragi ryiwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Yamusanze mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">mu gihugu cumye ata kibamwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Yaramushigikiye yongera amwitaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">amubungabunga nk’imbonero y’ijisho ryiwe,<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />nka kurya inkona yigisha ivyana vyayo kuguruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">ikabundikira ivyana bikiri bito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">igasanza amababa yayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">mu kubijana<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene ni we yamuja imbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">nta mana y’inyamahanga yari kumwe na we.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Yamucishije mu mitumba miremire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">amugaburira ku vyamwa vyo mu mirima yaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Yamugaburiye ku buki bwo mu gitandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">amuha no ku mavuta y’imyelayo yameze kw’isi y’urutare.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Yabahaye amata y’ikivuguto y’inka n’ay’intama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">abagaburira n’ibinure vy’intama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">abaha amapfizi y’intama n’impene y’i Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">hamwe n’ingano nziza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Mwanyoye ku mutobe uryoshe uganwe mu nzabibu.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Ariko Yeshuruni amaze kuvyibuha, antera akagere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">amaze kurya agahaga, yaravyibushe, aratatagara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Maze ava ku Mana yamubumvye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">akengera ca Gitandara c’agakiza kiwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Bayiteye kubagirira ishari mu gusenga imana z’inyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">bayirakisha ibizira bakoze.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Bashikaniye ibimazi abadayimoni atari Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">bashikanira imana batari bwigere babona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">imana nshasha z’ivyaduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">izo ba sekuruza batigeze batinya.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Mwagararije ca Gitandara cabavyaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">mwibagira Imana yabavyaye.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarabibonye, aca arabazinukwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">kuko yari ashavujwe n’abahungu n’abakobwa biwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Aravuga ati: ‘Nzobahisha mu nyonga hanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">maze ndabe amaherezo yabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">kuko ari urunganwe rwononekaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">abana atari abizigirwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Banteje ishari ibitari imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">uburake bwanje buraziriringa kubera ibigirwamana vyabo ata co bimaze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Nanje nzobateza kwipfuza ivy’abantu batari babereye no kwitwa ihanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">ndabateze kugirira ishari ihanga ritagira n’ugutahura.’<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Kuko umuriro w’uburake bwanje wamaze kwaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">uturira gushitsa epfo i kuzimu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Uzotongora isi n’ibiyezeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">udomeke n’amatanguriro y’imisozi.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Nzobarundanyako ivyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">ndabamarireko imyampi yanje.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Nzobakonyesha inzara, inyonko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">n’izindi ngwara zica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">nzobarekurira mu menyo y’ibikoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">ndabaterere no mu bumara bw’inzoka z’imvuvyi zikwega mu mukungugu.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ku nzira, inkota izobamarira abana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">i muhira, bose bazocika ivutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Abagore n’abagabo bazotikira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">co kimwe n’abana n’abatama.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Ndavuga nti nari nashatse kubashwiragiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">ngahanagura amazina yabo ntibazokwongere kwibukwa mu bantu,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />ariko nanse agakekezo k’abansi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">bari guhava babitahura ukundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">bakavuga bati: ‘Inkomezi zacu ni zo zabatsinze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">si <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabibagize.’<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Ariko Isirayeli ni ihanga ata co ryiyumvira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">nta bwenge bagira mu vyo bakora.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Iyo baba bafise ubwenge botahuye ibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">bakiyumvira kw’iherezo ryabo.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Mbega umuntu umwe yonesha abantu igihumbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">canke babiri bakirukana ibihumbi cumi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Ntivyoshoboka, kiretse ca Gitandara yabagurishije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabarekuriye mu maboko yabo.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Kuko igitandara cabo kitameze nk’Igitandara cacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">n’abansi bacu baravyemeza.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Inzabibu zabo zakomotse ku muzabibu w’i Sodomu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">no mu mirima y’i Gomora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Inzabibu zabo zuzuye ubumara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">amahando yazo ni umururazi.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Umuvinyu wabo ni ubumara bw’inzoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">ni ubumara bwica bw’inkoma.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Mbega ibi sinabishinguye mu bubiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">sinavyugaraniye ahabitse ubutunzi bwanje?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Uguhora ni ukwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">ni jewe nzokwishura umuntu ibikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Igihe nicagera, ibirenge vyabo bizonyerera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">umusi w’ivyago urabegereje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">kandi ibitegerezwa kubashikako birabashitseko vuba.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azocira urubanza abantu biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">kandi azogirira impuhwe abasavyi biwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">niyabona ko inkomezi zabo zose ziheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">ata n’umwe agisigaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">naho yoba umugurano canke uwidegemvya.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Azobaza ati: ‘Mbega imana zabo ziri hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">Ca gitandara bahungirako kiri he?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Mbega izo mana ziri hehe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">zimwe zarya ibinure vy’ibimazi vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">zikanywa n’imivinyu n’ibindi binyobwa bazishikanira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Nizihaguruke zibafashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">nizibahe ubuhungiro.’<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />None rero nimumenye ko jewe nyene ari jewe Mana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Nta yindi mana atari jewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Ni jewe nica ngakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ni jewe nkomeretsa nkongera nkavura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">kandi nta wushobora kugira ico arokora mu kuboko kwanje.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Ndugije ukuboko kwanje ndakurabisha kw’ijuru mvuga nti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Ndahiye ukubaho kwanje kw’ibihe vyose.<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Ninakarisha inkota yanje ica ibibatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ukuboko kwanje kukayifata ngatangura guca imanza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">nzokwihora abansi banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">nsubirize mu nkoko abanyanse.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Imyampi yanje nzoyiboreza amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">inkota yanje ndayigaburire imisoso:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">amaraso y’abishwe n’ay’abafashwe mpiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ihekenye imitwe y’abatware b’abansi.<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Yemwe banyamahanga, nimunezeranwe n’abantu bayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">kuko azohora amaraso y’abasavyi bayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">azokwihora abansi biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">atange impongano ku gihugu c’ubwoko bwiwe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Mose azanana na Yosuwa mwene Nuni, avuga ayo majambo yose y’iyo ndirimbo abantu bose bamwumviriza. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Mose ahejeje gusubiriramwo ayo majambo Abisirayeli bose, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />arababwira ati: “Mushire ku muzirikanyi amajambo yose ndababwiriye ku mugaragaro uwu musi, kugira ngo muzotegeke abana banyu gukurikiza neza amajambo y’ibi Vyagezwe. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Ayo majambo si ayasanzwe, ariko ni ubuzima bwanyu. Ni yo azobaha kurambira mu gihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo hakurya ya Yorodani ngo mucegukire.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose apfira ku musozi Nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Uwo musi nyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Haguruka uduge mu misozi ya Abarimu, ushike i Nebo muri Mowabu, ahahereranye na Yeriko, wihweze Kanani, igihugu mpaye Abisirayeli nk’iragi ryabo. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Uwo musozi uza kudugako ni wo uza gupfirako, uhamvye ab’i wanyu bakwitangiye, nk’uko mwenewanyu Aroni yapfiriye ku musozi Hori, agasanga abamwitangiye imbere. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Ivyo ndabigize kuko mwempi mwampemukiye imbere y’Abisirayeli ku mazi y’i Meriba i Kadeshi mu bugaragwa bw’i Zini, kandi kuko muterekanye ukwera kwanje mu Bisirayeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Ni co gituma ico gihugu uzokirabira kure, ariko ntuzokwinjira mu gihugu mpaye ubwoko bwa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Mose ahezagira imiryango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Uwu ni wo muhezagiro umuntu w’Imana Mose yahezagiye Abisirayeli imbere y’urupfu rwiwe. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yazananye i Sinayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">abarasira ari i Seyiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">yabakayanganiye ari ku musozi Parani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Yazananye n’ibihumbi cumi vy’abera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">kandi imiriro ari vyo vyagezwe yava mu kuboko kwiwe kw’i buryo.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Ni ivy’ukuri urakunda abantu bawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">abera bose bari mu biganza vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Bose bikubita ku birenge vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">bakumva amajambo avuye kuri wewe,<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />ari vyo Vyagezwe Mose yaduhaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">iragi ridasanzwe ku bwoko bwa Yakobo.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari Umwami muri Yeshuruni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">igihe abatware bari bakoranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">imiryango yose y’Abisirayeli ikoraniye hamwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Ab’umuryango wa Reyubeni baragahoraho ntibagapfe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">abiwe ntibakabe bake.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Ku muryango wa Yuda, Mose yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, wumve amarira ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">umusubize mu bwoko bwiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Bahe inkomezi zo kwigwanira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">ubashoboze kugwanya abansi babo.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Abalewi Mose yabavuzeko ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“Tumimu na Urimu zawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">wazihaye Lewi umukozi wawe w’umwizigirwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Wamugeragereje i Masa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">utonganira na we ku mazi y’i Meriba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Abalewi bumviye ijambo ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">bazigama isezerano ryawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Bakurutishije abavyeyi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">birengagije incuti zabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">ntibitaho abana babo.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Bazokwigisha Yakobo amabwirizwa yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">na Isirayeli bayigishe Ivyagezwe vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Bashikana imibavu imbere yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">n’ibimazi bituriwe ku gicaniro cawe.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Hezagira ibikorwa vyabo, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">ushime ibikorwa vy’amaboko yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Vunagura amafyigo y’abansi babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">usiribange ababagwanya ntibasubire kuvyura umutwe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ku muryango wa Benyamini Mose yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“Uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akunda namuruhukireko atekanirwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">kuko amukingira ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">kandi uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akunda, amuhe kuruhukira mu gikiriza ciwe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ku ba Yosefu yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahezagire igihugu ciwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">agihezagize ikime kiva kw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">n’amazi ava mw’isi i kuzimu.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Abahezagize ivyamwa vyiza vyezwa n’izuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">n’ivyamwa vyera uko ukwezi guheze.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Abahe ivyimburwa vyo mu misozi ya kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">n’ivyo mu mitumba yamyeho,<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />bazogire imigisha yose yo kw’isi mu kunengesera kwayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">n’ubuntu bw’iyari mu gisaka caka umuriro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Iyo migisha yose izobe ku mutwe wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">isharize urugori rw’umuganwa muri benewabo.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Afise igihagararo nk’ic’impfizi nkuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">amahembe yiwe ameze nk’ay’impfizi y’imbogo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ni yo azocumitisha amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">gushika no ku yari ku mpera y’isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Abo ni ibihumbi cumi vy’Abefurayimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">n’ibihumbi vy’abo kwa Manase.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Kuri Zebuloni na Isakari yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Nezerwa Zebuloni mu ngendo zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">nawe Isakari, uhimbarwe mu mahema yawe.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Bazokoranya abantu ku musozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">banahashikanire ibimazi vy’ukugororoka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">bazonezererwa umusesekara wo mu biyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">n’itunga rihishijwe mu musenyi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Ku muryango wa Gadi yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Arahezagiwe uwagura intara ya Gadi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi azohabunda nk’intambwe y’ingore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">itantamura igitugu canke umutwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Abagadi bitoreye intara nziza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">umugabane w’umurongozi watwawe na bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Igihe abatware bari bakoraniye hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">Gadi yakoze ivyo kugororoka kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">yitondera n’ivyagezwe ku bwa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Ku muryango wa Dani Mose yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ni icana c’intambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">gisimvye kivuye i Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Ku muryango wa Nafutali, Mose yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Ewe Nafutali, wuzuye ubuntu bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’imihezagiro yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">Uzokwegukira ikiyaga n’igice c’ubumanuko.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kuri Asheri, yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Asheri arahezagiwe gusumba abandi benewabo bose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">niyubahwe na benewabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">ibirenge vyiwe vyoge mu mavuta ya elayo.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Amarembo y’ibisagara vyiwe yugazwe ivyuma n’imiringa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">yamane inkomezi imyaka y’ukubaho kwiwe yose.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Nta wuhwanye n’Imana yawe, yewe Yeshuruni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">itambuka amajuru ije kugukiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ikamanukana n’ibicu mu bwiza bwayo.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ni we buhungiro bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">akureruye mu biganza vyiwe ibihe vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Azokwirukana abansi bawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">imbere y’uko uvuga uti: ‘Barandure!’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Maze Isirayeli kizoheza kibe impore.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Uruvyaro rwa Yakobo ruzoba amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">mu gihugu c’ingano n’umuvinyu mushasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">aho ijuru ritanga urume.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Urahezagiwe, yewe Isirayeli!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Ni nde ameze nkawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ubwoko bwakijijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we nkinzo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ni we nkota yawe y’intsinzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Abansi bawe bazoza bajugumira imbere yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">nawe uzobahonyora ku gakanu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Nuko Mose aduga ku musozi Nebo avuye mu kiyaya c’i Mowabu, aja kw’isonga rya Pisiga, aharabana na Yeriko. Ahagaze aho, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amwereka ca gihugu cose, kuva i Gileyadi gushika i Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />intara yose ya Nafutali, iya Efurayimu n’iya Manase, intara yose ya Yuda ishika ku Kiyaga Mediterane, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />abona Negebu n’intara yose iva mu kiyaya ca Yeriko igaca mu gisagara c’ibigazi igashika i Zowari. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: “Ico ni co gihugu nasezeranishije indahiro Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, igihe navuga nti: ‘Nzogiha uruvyaro rwanyu.’ Nakuretse ngo ukiboneshe amaso yawe, ariko ntuzojabuka ngo ucinjiremwo.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Maze Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca apfira aho i Mowabu, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabivuze. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Amuhamba i Mowabu, mu kiyaya kirabana n’i Beti-Peyori, ariko gushika n’ubu nta wuzi aho imva yiwe iherereye. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Mose yapfuye amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo ibiri, ariko amaso yiwe yari akibona neza, kandi yari agifise inkomezi yamanye. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Maze Abisirayeli bagandarira Mose imisi mirongo itatu mu kiyaya ca Mowabu, gushika ikiringo co kugandara giheze.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Ico gihe Yosuwa mwene Nuni yari yuzuye impwemu y’ubwenge, kuko Mose yari yamurambitseko ibiganza. Maze Abisirayeli baramwumvira, bagakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarategetse Mose vyose.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Kuva ico gihe, nta muvugishwa yasubiriye kubaho muri Isirayeli yangana na Mose, uwibonanira n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaso mu yandi, <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />uwakoze ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza nk’ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye Mose gukora muri Egiputa, kuri Farawo no ku batware biwe, no ku gihugu cose. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Nta n’umwe yigeze akora ibikorwa bikomeye kandi biteye ubwoba nk’ivyo Mose yakoreye mu maso y’Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>